Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:02.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}门阵俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.25,0:02:08.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人们总是问我不识泰勒德顿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}People always ask me if I know Tyler Durden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:10.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三分钟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.13,0:02:12.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}时间到 备引爆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is it. Ground zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.22,0:02:16.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要点什来纪念这一刻？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Want to say a few words for the occasion?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:19.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当你嘴里含著枪管 只能支支吾吾地话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With a gun barrel between your teeth, you speak only in vowels.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.93,0:02:21.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道该什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't think of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在那一刻 我完全忘记了 泰勒控制著破计画\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For a second, I forget about Tyler's controlled demolition thing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:28.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怀疑那把枪有多\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I wonder how clean that gun is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.15,0:02:30.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}令人激动的时刻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's getting exciting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:33.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}俗话 人总会伤害所爱的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That old saying, how you always hurt the one you love,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实反之亦然\N{\rEN\blur0.8}well, it works both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:39.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们坐在最前排看这爆破的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have front-row seats for this theater of mass destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:42.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}破计画小组\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Demolitions Committee of Project Mayhem
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:47.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在十二楝大楼的地基绑上吉利丁炸弹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}wrapped the foundation columns of a dozen buildings with blasting gelatin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.08,0:02:49.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雨分钟后 炸弹就会引爆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In two minutes, primary charges will blow base charges
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.80,0:02:53.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}条街以内的围都会变成垣残壁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and a few blocks will be reduced to smoldering rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.76,0:02:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道这些 因为泰勒知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know this because Tyler knows this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:03:00.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雨分半钟 想想我们的成就吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two and a half. Think of everything we've accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.47,0:03:06.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}突然间我终于意识到所有这些 枪 炸弹、革命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Suddenly I realize that all of this - the gun, the bombs, the revolution -
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都跟玛拉辛格这女人有关\N{\rEN\blur0.8}has got something to do with a girl named Marla Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:13.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伯 伯有女人的奶子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bob. Bob had bitch tits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.24,0:03:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}存的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:18.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是得睾丸癌的自助团体\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This was a support group for men with testicular cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.62,0:03:21.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把我抱个满怀的就是伯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The big moosie slobbering all over me, that was Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:24.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们仍然是男人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're still men.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:26.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我们是男人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, we're men.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:28.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}男人是我们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Men is what we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:32.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}八个月前 伯切除了睾丸 然后接受荷尔蒙治疗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bob had had his testicles removed. Then hormone therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:36.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为翠丸素太高 导致他的雌性激素上升\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He developed bitch tits 'cause his testosterone was too high
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.13,0:03:38.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以他长出 了女人的奶子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and his body upped the estrogen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.30,0:03:42.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一这就是我的归地 一他们又要再我的胸部抽脂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That was where I fit.   -They'll have to drain my pecs again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.68,0:03:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巨大湿黏的奶子中间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Between those huge, sweating tits
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:48.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}巨大到足以与神的伟大亚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that hung enormous, the way you'd think of God's as big.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:50.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 换你哭了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}OK, you cry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.65,0:03:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 等等 我头起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, wait. Back up. Let me start earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:57.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}六个月以来，我无法入睡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For six months, I couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:03:59.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我无法入睡……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I couldn't sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:03.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因著失眠 我感受不到现实世界\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With insomnia, nothing's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:05.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都好空虚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything's far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.83,0:04:08.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每件事情都成了拷贝的拷贝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything's a copy of a copy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}的拷贝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of a copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.09,0:04:15.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像太空探险的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When deep-space exploration ramps up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发现一切都以熟知的公司命名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it'll be the corporations that name everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.38,0:04:20.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}IBM星体\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The IBM Stellar Sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}微软星云\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Microsoft Galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:25.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}星巴克星球\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Planet Starbucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:28.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你这星期出差去处理一些漏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you out of town this week to cover some red flags.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.52,0:04:32.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天一定是星期二 因为他繁著矢车菊蓝的领带\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It must have been Tuesday. He had on his cornflower-blue tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:36.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要我先暂时放下手工作？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want me to deprioritize my reports until you advise of a status upgrade?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:41.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些比较重要 这是你的机票折价卷 路上有任何意外就打给我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Prioritize these. Here's your flight coupons. Call me if there's any snags.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.53,0:04:45.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他很有精神 一定是喝了不少咖啡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was full of pep. Must have had his grande latte enema.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:52.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像其它许多人一样 我迷上了宜家的家具装潢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like so many others, I had become a Slave to the IKEA nesting instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:57.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我想订购艾瑞卡派佳丽的防套 一请稍等\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'd like to order Erika Pekkari dust ruffles.   -Please hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:05:00.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我看到某些有意思的东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I saw something clever, like a coffee table
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:03.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如阴阳形状的咖啡桌 我一定要买回来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the shape of a yin-yang, I had to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.35,0:05:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像克里普斯的个人瓣公室组合\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Klipsk personal office unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:09.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈佛崔克的健身脚踏车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Hovetrekke home exerbike.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.43,0:05:13.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者欧汉沙的绿色条纹沙发\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or the Ohamshab sofa with the Strinne green stripe pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:18.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}甚至瑞斯兰帕的再生灯具\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even the Ryslampa wire lamps of environmentally friendly unbleached paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:20.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会草草翻阁邮购目录想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd flip through catalogs and wonder:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪种餐具组最能表现我个人风格？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What kind of dining set defines me as a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:29.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我全部都有了 甚至是有小气泡瑕疵的玻璃盘子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had it all. Even the glass dishes with tiny bubbles and imperfections,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:31.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}证明那是由诚实\N{\rEN\blur0.8}proof that they were crafted by the honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.75,0:05:34.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}勤的手工艺术家……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}hard-working, indigenous peoples of...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:36.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-请稍等 ……随便啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Please hold.   -...wherever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:40.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们以前常看色情书刊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We used to read pornography.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:42.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在则是看邮购目录\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now it was the Horchow collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.47,0:05:46.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一不 失眠症不会死人的 一嗜睡症呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No. You can't die of insomnia.   -What about narcolepsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:51.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}突然睡著 在陌生的地方醒来 我不知道我怎到那儿的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I nod off, I wake up in strange places. I have no idea how I got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:55.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你得放心情 一你能为我开点什药？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You need to lighten up.   -Can you please just give me something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:58.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五颜六色的药丸……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Red and blue Tuinals, lipstick-red Seconals...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.23,0:06:02.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 你需要健康自然的睡眠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. You need healthy, natural sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:06.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吃点草本镇定剂亚多做运动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chew some valerian root and get more exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一别这样 我很痛苦 一你想要见识痛苦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey, come on. I'm in pain.   -You wanna see pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:18.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}星期二晚上到教堂 去看看那些得丸癌的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Swing by First Methodist, Tuesday nights. See the guys with testicular cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:21.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那才是痛苦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:40.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直想要三个小孩 两个男孩和一个女孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I always wanted three kids. Two boys and a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.11,0:06:43.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}敏蒂想要雨个女孩和一个男孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mindy wanted two girls and a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:46.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我俩意见一直不合\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We never could agree on anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:51.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她上礼拜生了第一个宝宝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, she had her first child last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:53.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个女孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:06:57.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟她·跟她的新丈夫生的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With her... with her new husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.63,0:07:03.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢天谢地\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And thank God. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.26,0:07:06.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我很替她高兴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I'm glad for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.47,0:07:10.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为那是她应得的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because she deserves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:17.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位 ，言谢谢汤马斯与我们分享\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone, let's thank Thomas for sharing himself with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:19.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢 汤马斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:23.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在这里看见很多勇气\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I look around this room, and I see a lot of courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.53,0:07:25.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那也给我力量\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that gives me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.65,0:07:27.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们给予彼此力量\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We give each other strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:29.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该是一对一分组的时候了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's time for the one-on-ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:34.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们以汤马斯为例 敞开心胸吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So let's all of us follow Thomas's example and really open ourselves up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:37.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请各自寻找搭档？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could you find a partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:42.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是这样识大奶子的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And this is how I met the big moosie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:46.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他早已热泪盈眶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His eyes already shrink-wrapped in tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:52.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}膝盖摩擦 小碎步走向我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Knees together. Those awkward little steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:00.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我叫鲍伯 一伯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-My name is Bob.   -Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.98,0:08:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伯曾是健美冠军\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bob had been a champion bodybuilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道晚间电视那个健胸节目？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know that chest expansion program on late-night TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:08.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是他的主意\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was his idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我曾经使用禁药\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was a juicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.70,0:08:12.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道……使用类固醇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know - using steroids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:17.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}戴伯诺跟……威斯特洛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Diabonal and...Wisterol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，他们是用来打在赛马身上的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, they use that on racehorses, for Christ's sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:26.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我破产了 离婚了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now I'm bankrupt, I'm divorced,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:33.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的雨个孩子长大了 甚至连电话都不肯回\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my two grown kids won't even return my phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:39.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这坦白的陌生人我很感动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Strangers with this kind of honesty make me go a big, rubbery one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:43.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系……柯纳里斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go ahead... Cornelius.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以哭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接著……就这发生了 我不再压抑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then... something happened. I let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:06.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:08.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完全淹没在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lost in oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:11.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}黑暗 寂静和圆满之中\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dark and silent and complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.89,0:09:15.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我找到了 自 由\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I found freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:18.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失去全部希望就是自由\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Losing all hope was freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.52,0:09:22.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.23,0:09:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}初生的婴儿都没有我睡得沉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Babies don't sleep this well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:33.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后来我上瘾了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I became addicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:34.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鼠伦自助团体 酒匿名团体
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:35.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}诚实面对 学习暴怒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.04,0:09:45.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肺结核 如何面对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:51.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我不话 别人都会以为我快死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I didn't say anything, people always assumed the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:57.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们哭得越惨…… 向前向上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They cried harder...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:09:59.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就哭得越惨\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then I cried harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:02.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自助团体时间表 皮肤癌－ 臀病
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:12.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我们要打开色的门 心灵的大门……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now we're going to open the green door, the heart chakra...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:14.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我其实亚不会死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wasn't really dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.66,0:10:17.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没得癌症或者其他症\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wasn't host to cancer or parasites.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:21.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是被这个世界的生活所围住的 又小又温暖的中心点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was the warm little center that the life of this world crowded around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.71,0:10:26.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想像你的病痛是一道治疗你的白光\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Imagine your pain as a white ball of healing light.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:30.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那道光在你身上游移 治疗你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It moves over your body, healing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.51,0:10:34.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在 续冥想 别忘了呼吸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now keep this going. Remember to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:37.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向前走 通过这房间的后门\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And step forward through the back door of the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.89,0:10:40.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那道门通往哪里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where does it lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:42.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的洞穴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To your cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:46.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走进你的洞穴里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Step forward into your cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:49.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:52.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走进洞穴的深处\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're going deeper into your cave,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:58.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会在那里找到你的力量动物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're going to find your power animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:01.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滑行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:14.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我每晚都会死一次\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every evening I died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:18.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每晚我又重生一次\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And every evening I was born again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.93,0:11:20.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}复活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Resurrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.02,0:11:27.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伯爱我 因为他为 我的罩丸也被切除了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bob loved me because he thought my testicles were removed too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.27,0:11:31.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在那儿紧贴他的奶子 备哭泣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Being there, pressed against his tits, ready to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:34.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我的假期\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This was my vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.11,0:11:41.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她……毁了一切\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And she... ruined everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:43.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是癌症的 对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is cancer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:51.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}璃拉辛格这小妞根本没有罩丸癌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This chick, Marla Singer, did not have testicular cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是个子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She was a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.63,0:11:55.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她根本没有病\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She had no diseases at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:12:00.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我曾经在星期四的血液寄生团体 无牵无 见过她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had seen her at Free And Clear, my blood parasites group, Thursdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:03.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有在一个月 雨次的 镰刀型红血球症围体 希望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then at Hope, my bimonthly sickle-cell circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:08.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有在星期五晚上的肺结核团体 把握今天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And again at Seize The Day, my tuberculosis, Friday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:14.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛拉 这个游客\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marla, the big tourist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.82,0:12:17.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她的言反射出我的言\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her lie reflected my lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.32,0:12:19.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}突然之间 我没有感觉了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And suddenly, I felt nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:24.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我哭不出来了 所以 我又睡不著了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I couldn't cry. So once again, I couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.01,0:12:39.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下一个团里 在冥想结束后\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Next group, after guided meditation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:42.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在打开你的心灵之门后 抱时间时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}after we open our heart chakras, when it's time to hug,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.05,0:12:45.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要抓住玛拉辛格那婊子 亚且大喊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll grab that bitch Marla Singer and scream:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.02,0:12:50.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛拉 你这子 你这游客 我需要这个 滚出去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marla, you liar! You big tourist! I need this! Now, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:53.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我四天没睡了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hadn't slept in four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:55.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等它干……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll just let that dry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.07,0:12:59.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当你有失眠症时 你无法真的入睡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When you have insomnia, you're never really asleep
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也没有恩的清醒过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're never really awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:08.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始今晚的交流 克洛伊有一些话想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To begin tonight's communion, Chloe would like to say a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，是 是克洛伊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah. Chloe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.17,0:13:15.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克洛伊看上去像会走路的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chloe looked the way Meryl Streep's skeleton would look
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:19.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且还会在派对上四处走动 对大家微笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you made it walk around a party being extra nice to everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.22,0:13:22.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还活著\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:24.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但不知道会活多久\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I don't know for how long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:28.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有人能给我确切的答案\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's as much certainty as anyone can give me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.43,0:13:31.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是我有个好消息\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I've got some good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:34.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不再害怕死亡了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I no longer have any fear of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:42.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是……我现在很孤单\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But... |am in a pretty lonely place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:45.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有人意跟我做爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one will have sex with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:47.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我快死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so close to the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:51.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想要做最后一次爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and all I want is to get laid for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.91,0:13:54.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我家里有A片\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have pornographic movies in my apartment,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:58.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}－还有润滑剂和春药 －谢谢 克洛伊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-and lubricants and amyl nitrite.   -Thank you, Chloe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:01.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们谢谢克洛伊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone, let's thank Chloe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢 克洛伊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Chloe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.47,0:14:10.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在 我们备好冥想吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, let's ready ourself for guided meditation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:15.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你站在洞穴的入口\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're standing at the entrance of your cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:19.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你走进洞穴 往里面走……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You step inside your cave and you walk...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:22.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我有癌症 我会把它命名为玛拉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I did have a tumor, I'd name it Marla.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.95,0:14:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛拉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marla.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.32,0:14:27.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像嘴巴里的伤口\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The scratch on the roof of your mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.41,0:14:30.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不去舔就会自然痊愈 但你忍不住要去舔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that would heal if you could stop tonguing it, but you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:34.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……越走越深入\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..deeper into your cave as you walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.79,0:14:39.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感受身治疗的力量包围著你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You feel a healing energy all around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去找你的力量动物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now find your power animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滑行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:55.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 开始分组吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}OK. Let's partner up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.98,0:14:58.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个今晚对你很特别的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pick someone special to you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:06.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.07,0:15:09.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我们需要谈谈 一好啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We need to talk.   -Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:16.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我知道你的底细 一什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm onto you.   -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:19.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对 你是假的 妳根本不会死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. You're a faker. You're not dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:21.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什鹰？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.17,0:15:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从西藏哲学跟希薇亚普拉斯的角度 我知道我们都会死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the Tibetan-philosophy, Sylvia Plath sense, I know we're all dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:29.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是你跟克洛伊的死法会不同\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you're not dying the way Chloe back there is dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.68,0:15:31.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.43,0:15:33.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你是个游客\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you're a tourist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.64,0:15:37.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我见过你 我见过你参加黑色素瘤 见过你参加肺结核\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've seen you. I saw you at melanoma, I saw you at tuberculosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:40.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还见过你参加晕丸癌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw you at testicular cancer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.15,0:15:42.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我见过你的演\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw you practicing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.36,0:15:44.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一演什 一怎我走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Practicing what?   -Telling me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.57,0:15:47.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果跟你想像的一样……伯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is it going as well as you hoped... "Rupert"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:51.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我会揭发你 一去啊 我也会揭发你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'll expose you.   -Go ahead. I'll expose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:54.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一起来，自 己哭出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come together. Let yourselves cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.04,0:16:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊 你为什要这做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God. Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:07.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这比看电影便宜 还有免费咖啡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's cheaper than a movie and coffee's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:11.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}著 这很重要 这些是于我的团体\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, this is important. These are my groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:13.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我参加这些团体已经超过一年了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been coming for over a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.39,0:16:16.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你为什要这做？  -我不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why do you do it?   -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.48,0:16:20.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当人们为你要死了 他们真的会你倾 而不是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When people think you're dying, they really listen to you instead of...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而不是等著换他们发言\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Instead of waiting for their turn to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:26.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，是 是啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:30.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完全分享你的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Share yourself, completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:34.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会想要续 这会上瘾的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't want to get into this. It becomes an addiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:36.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一真的 一我没开玩笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Really?   -I'm not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.91,0:16:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果有其他假冒的人 我会哭不出来 我需要发\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't cry if another faker is present, and I need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:43.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请你另找其他地方吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you gotta find somewhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:46.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是你的问题 不关我的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Candy-stripe a cancer ward. It's not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:51.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等 等一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait a second. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:55.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们平分好了 好 淋巴瘤和肺结核给你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll split up the week, OK? You take lymphoma and tuberculosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:16:58.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肺结核给你 我太爱抽烟了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You take tuberculosis. My smoking doesn't go over at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:17:02.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没问题 好 睾丸癌没有争吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good. Fine. Testicular cancer should be no contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}技术上来 我比你更有资格去 因为你还有丸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Technically, I have more right to be there. You still have your balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:09.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你在开玩笑吧 一我不知道 是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're kidding.   -I dunno. Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:10.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.45,0:17:13.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你要什 一我要参加寄生团体\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What do you want?   -I'll take the parasites.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.45,0:17:16.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妳不能雨个都去 血液寄生给你吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't have both. Take the blood parasites.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:17.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要脑寄生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want brain parasites.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:20.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我参加血液寄生 但是我要呆症的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll take the blood, but I want brain dementia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:23.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我要那个 －不能整个脑都给你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I want that.   -You can't have the whole brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:26.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你分到四个 我只分到雨个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So far, you have four. I only have two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.30,0:17:29.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 雨个寄生团体都给你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}OK. Take both the parasites. They're yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:32.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们现在各分到三个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now we both have three...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 你的衣服只拿了一半\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! You left half your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:58.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一什 你把它们拿来卖 一没错 我在卖衣服\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What, are you selling those?   -Yes, I'm selling some clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.83,0:18:00.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我们各有三天 也就是六天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, we each have three. That's six.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:03.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第七天呢？我要肠癌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about the seventh day? I want bowel cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:05.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这女孩是有备而来的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The girl had done her homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.67,0:18:10.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一不 不 我要肠癌 一那也是你的最爱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No. No. I want bowel cancer.   -That's your favorite too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.05,0:18:14.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-以为我不会发现？  -著 我们平分\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Tried to slip it by me, eh?   -Look, we'll split it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:18.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你每个月的单数调去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take the first and third Sunday of the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.31,0:18:21.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成交\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.14,0:18:27.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一起来像是道别 -别那郑重其事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Looks like this is goodbye.   -Let's not make a big thing out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.86,0:18:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要怎不郑重其事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's this for not making a big thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 玛拉 ！ 玛拉 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Marla! Marla!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:42.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我们交换电话号码吧 一需要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Maybe we should exchange numbers.   -Should we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.79,0:18:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许有时会想交换时间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We might wanna switch nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.21,0:18:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:55.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是这样识玛拉辛格的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is how I met Marla Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.84,0:19:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛拉的生活哲学就是她随时有可能死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marla's philosophy of life was that she might die at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.64,0:19:03.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她可悲的是她一直都没死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The tragedy, she said, was that she didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.27,0:19:05.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没写名字 你是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It doesn't have your name! Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.73,0:19:08.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}柯纳里斯？伯？崔维斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cornelius? Rupert? Travis?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:11.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你每晚给的蠢名字的其中一个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any of the stupid names you give each night?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:17.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}醒来时你在西雅图机场\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wake up at SeaTac.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:19.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金山机场 洛杉机场\N{\rEN\blur0.8}SFO. LAX.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.99,0:19:25.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}醒来时你在芝加哥机场 达拉斯机场 巴尔地摩机场\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wake up at O'Hare. Dallas Fort Worth. BWI.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:30.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太平洋 山区 中央时区 早一小时、晚一小时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pacific. Mountain. Central. Lose an hour. Gain an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的航班还要雨个小时才开始登记\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Check-in for that flight isn't for another two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.55,0:19:37.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是你的生命 一分一分地消逝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is your life, and it's ending one minute at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.97,0:19:41.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}醒来时你在温哥华机场\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wake up at Air Harbor International.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.89,0:19:45.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你在不同的时间 不同的地方醒来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you wake up at a different time, in a different place,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.98,0:19:48.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会变成不同的人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}could you wake up as a different person?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:52.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我旅行所到之处 一次性的生活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everywhere I travel, tiny life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.98,0:19:57.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一包糖 一杯奶精 一块奶油\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Single-serving sugar, single-serving cream, single pat of butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.41,0:20:01.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}微波炉套餐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The microwave cordon bleu hobby kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:06.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}二合一洗发精 漱口水试用 包 小肥皂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shampoo-conditioner combos. Sample package mouthwash. Tiny bars of soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:12.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在每架飞机上遇到的人 都只是一次性的朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The people I meet on each flight, they're single-serving friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:18.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在起飞和降落前 我们分享一点时间 但也就这样了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Between takeoff and landing, we have our time together, but that's all we get.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:21.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:24.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在一定的时间内\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On a long-enough time line,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:27.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个人的生存率都会超近于零\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the survival rate for everyone drops to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:31.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是一名汽车回收协调员 我的工作就是应用一些则\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was a recall coordinator. My job was to apply the formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:34.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}婴儿就是这里飞出描风玻璃的 三分\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The infant went through the windshield. Three points.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:38.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们公司的新车 以时速100公里在某处旅行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A new car built by my company leaves somewhere traveling at 60mph.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.53,0:20:40.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后菡轮锁死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The rear differential locks up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.91,0:20:43.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小孩的吊带卡在烟灰缸上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The teenager's braces are stuck to the ashtray.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.87,0:20:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个画面可以做戒烟广告\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Might make a good anti-smoking ad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:49.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}车子撞毁燃烧 人都困在车内\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The car crashes and burns with everyone trapped inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.12,0:20:51.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在 我们应该回收这款车型？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, should we initiate a recall?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:53.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这爸爸一定很胖\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The father must've been huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.34,0:20:57.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到座位上油脂燃烧的痕了？ 尼龙亲衫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See where the fat burned to the seat? The polyester shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.13,0:20:59.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常前卫的艺术\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very modern art.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.13,0:21:01.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}将这类车的数量以A表示\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take the number of vehicles in the field, A.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.97,0:21:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乘以故障机率以B表示\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Multiply it by the probable rate of failure, B.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:08.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得出来的答案再乘以 官司 需要的费用以C表示\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Multiply the result by the average out-of-court settlement, C.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:10.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}A乘以B乘以C……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}AxBxC...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:12.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等于X\N{\rEN\blur0.8}equals X.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.40,0:21:16.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}若X小于善后处理费用的话 我们就不回收\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If X is less than the cost of a recall, we don't do one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.49,0:21:21.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种意外常发生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are there a lot of these kinds of accidents?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:23.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多到你无法相信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wouldn't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.74,0:21:27.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是哪家汽车公司的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which car company do you work for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:29.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很大的一家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A major one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.21,0:21:35.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每次飞机起飞或降落时摇晃得很属害\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every time the plane banked too sharply on takeoff or landing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.75,0:21:39.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都祈祷能机或是空中爆炸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I prayed for a crash or a mid-air collision.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:40.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什都行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.39,0:21:54.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你在出差途中死亡 毒理赔是一般的三倍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Life insurance pays off triple if you die on a business trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.82,0:21:59.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“如果您的座位在紧急出口的旁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"If you are seated in an emergency exit row
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.20,0:22:05.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}且觉得自 己无法承 或不承安全指示卡所列的义务\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"and feel unable or unwilling to perform the duties listed on the safety card,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.03,0:22:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“请告知机组人员为您另外安排座位”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"please ask a flight attendant to reseat you."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.33,0:22:14.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一责任重大 一想要换位子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's a lot of responsibility.   -Wanna switch seats?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.62,0:22:18.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我不确定能不能胜任那个工作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I'm not sure I'm the man for that particular job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:22.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三万英吹高空的紧急出口\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An exit-door procedure at 30,000 feet. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.92,0:22:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安全只是假象\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The illusion of safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.26,0:22:27.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我想也是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.80,0:22:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道机上为什有氧气罩？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know why they put oxygen masks on planes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.72,0:22:34.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一助我们呼吸 -氧气人兴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-SO you can breathe.   -Oxygen gets you high.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.65,0:22:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在一个难性的紧急事故里 人会大口呼吸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In a catastrophic emergency, you take giant panic breaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.44,0:22:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吸了氧气会变得愉快 ，温 就会面对现实\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Suddenly you become euphoric, docile. You accept your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.78,0:22:46.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上面都有写\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.45,0:22:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}紧急水面迫降 时速1000公里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Emergency water landing, 6(00mph.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.12,0:22:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}色惨白 像在印度的牛一样平静\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Blank faces. Calm as Hindu cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.79,0:22:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是 嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.33,0:22:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是个有趣的理论\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's an interesting theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.09,0:23:03.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你是做什的 一什意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What do you do?   -What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.72,0:23:05.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是做什工作的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you do for a living?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.22,0:23:08.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干嘛？你就可以假装有与趣？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why? So you can pretend you're interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.43,0:23:12.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.52,0:23:15.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的笑声有一种病态的望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a kind of sick desperation in your laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.86,0:23:21.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的公事包一模一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have the exact same briefcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.40,0:23:23.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肥皂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.65,0:23:26.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什？  -我制造 销售肥皂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Sorry?   -I make and I sell soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.57,0:23:29.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可是文明的产物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The yardstick of civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.58,0:23:32.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就这样识了·：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And this is how I met...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.37,0:23:34.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒德顿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Tyler Durden."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.41,0:23:36.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道如果你混合\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you know if you mix gasoline
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.33,0:23:39.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汽油和冷冻柳橙汁 就可以做成凝固汽油弹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and frozen orange juice, you can make napalm?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.84,0:23:42.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不 我不知道 是真的？  -真的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, I did not. Is that true?   -That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.59,0:23:46.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个人都可以用简单的家庭用品 制造出所有种类的炸弹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One can make all kinds of explosives using simple household items.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.26,0:23:48.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-真的？  -只要你有心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Really?   -If one were so inclined.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.02,0:23:58.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒 你是我至今碰过 最有趣的一次性朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler, you are by far the most interesting single-serving friend I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.56,0:24:05.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-飞机上所有的东西都是一次性的……  -噢 我懂了 真明\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Everything on a plane is single-serving...   -Oh, I get it. Very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.40,0:24:06.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.61,0:24:09.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那对你有什好处？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's that working out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.70,0:24:11.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什？  -明\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -Being clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.99,0:24:17.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一很多 -那就续保持吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Great.   -Keep it up, then. Keep it right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.21,0:24:20.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}礼貌的问题来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, a question of etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.33,0:24:23.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我经过时 应该要你看我的屁股还是跨下？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As I pass, do I give you the ass or the crotch?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.84,0:24:33.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会跟泰勒住是因为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How I came to live with Tyler is...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.26,0:24:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}航空公司关于行李震动的政策\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Airlines have this policy about vibrating luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.90,0:24:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有滴答声？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Was it ticking?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.48,0:24:49.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丢手不心滴嗒声 现代炸弹是无声\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Throwers don't worry. Modern bombs don't tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.86,0:24:52.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一什 ？丢手 －行李搬运工\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Sorry. Throwers?   -Baggage handlers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.74,0:24:57.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是只要行李震动 丢手就必须通知警察\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But when a Suitcase vibrates, the throwers have to call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.91,0:25:00.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的行李在震动？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My suitcase was vibrating?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.67,0:25:05.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这情况十之八九是电动刮刀 但是偶尔……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nine times out of ten it's an electric razor, but... every once in a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.09,0:25:11.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会是自慰按摩棒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's a dildo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.84,0:25:15.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这种情况下 公司规定不能给予使用者暗示\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's company policy never to imply ownership in the event of a dildo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.97,0:25:21.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们必 一根按摩棒 而不能 你的按摩棒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to use the indefinite article - "a dildo", never "your dildo".
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.94,0:25:23.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't own...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.86,0:25:33.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我所有的东西都在里面 我的CK衫 我的DKNY鞋 我的AX领带\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had everything in that suitcase. My CK shirts. My DKNY shoes. My AX ties.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.37,0:25:36.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.00,0:25:41.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 那是我的车 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! That's my car!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.13,0:25:49.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}皮尔森大楼 通往成功之路
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.67,0:25:51.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我家是在用档案组成的大楼里的 第15层\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Home was a condo on the 15th floor of a filing cabinet
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.63,0:25:53.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住著寡妇跟年轻专业人士\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for widows and young professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.01,0:25:56.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}壁是固的混凝土\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The walls were solid concrete.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.10,0:25:59.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}30公分厚的混凝土很重要 当你隔壁的居拿掉助器\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A foot of concrete's important when your next-door neighbor
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.48,0:26:02.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚且看比赛时把音量开到最大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}has to watch game shows at full volume.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.39,0:26:06.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者火把你的私人财产烧成灰\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or when a blast of debris that used to be your personal effects
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.77,0:26:10.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}落地窗炸出来 续吞吐火舌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}blows out of your windows and sails flaming into the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.95,0:26:19.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想过这些事情的发生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I suppose these things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.22,0:26:34.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上面……什都不剩了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's... nothing up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.43,0:26:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能进去 警方的命令\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't go into the unit. Police orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.48,0:26:48.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有人可以联络？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have somebody you can call?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.73,0:26:54.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真丢 房里只有调味料 没有食物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How embarrassing. A houseful of condiments and no food.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.41,0:26:59.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛拉辛格 555-0134
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.21,0:27:06.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警察后来告我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The police later told me the pilot light
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.29,0:27:10.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}炉子的母火可能熄减了 所以瓦斯外浅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}might have gone out, letting out a little bit of gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.21,0:27:13.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瓦斯慢慢充满公寓\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That gas could have slowly filled the condo -
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.88,0:27:16.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}50坪的空间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}1700 square feet with high ceilings -
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.38,0:27:18.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好天来慢慢累\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for days and days.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.56,0:27:29.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后来冰箱压缩机启动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then the refrigerators compressor could have clicked on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.28,0:27:32.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.40,0:27:37.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能到你的呼吸 你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can hear you breathing, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.08,0:27:47.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}佩柏街肥皂公司 泰勒德顿
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.42,0:27:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你问我 我也不知道为什打电话找他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you ask me now, I couldn't tell you why I called him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.59,0:28:35.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-喂？  -你是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hello?   -Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.55,0:28:40.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-泰勒 一你是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Tyler?   -Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.18,0:28:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.76,0:28:44.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在·我们在飞机上见过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We met... We met on the airplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.14,0:28:46.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有一样的公事包\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We had the same suitcase?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.72,0:28:50.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一嗯……那个明人 一噢 对 想起来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Uh... the clever guy.   -Oh, yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.73,0:28:56.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚才打给你 没有人接 我用公共电话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I called a second ago. There was no answer. I'm at a payphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.69,0:28:59.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对 我查了来电显示 我不接电话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I *69'd you. I never pick up my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.32,0:29:04.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-怎了 ？  -嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-So what's up?   -Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.20,0:29:06.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.33,0:29:09.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}了你也不会相信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not gonna believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.08,0:29:13.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这还算好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}\t could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.79,0:29:18.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}万一被女人趁你睡觉割掉你的老二 还在路上丢出车窗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A woman could cut off your penis while you sleep and toss it out of a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.76,0:29:20.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}命中注定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's always that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.01,0:29:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当你买家具时 你都会告自 己\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just, when you buy furniture, you tell yourself:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.14,0:29:26.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我最后一次买沙发\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the last sofa I'll need.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.43,0:29:30.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无发生什事 我都要好好保护这套沙发\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever else happens, I've got that sofa problem handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.31,0:29:33.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我什都有了 我有一套高级立体音响\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had it all. I had a stereo that was very decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.73,0:29:36.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常漂亮的衣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A wardrobe that was getting very respectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.36,0:29:39.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我乎什都有了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was close to being complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.11,0:29:42.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一妈的 老兄 全部都没了 一全部都没了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Shit, man. And now it's all gone.   -All gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.07,0:29:44.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全部都没了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.58,0:29:48.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道羽被是什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know what a duvet is?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.33,0:29:52.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一棉被 一只不过是毯子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-A comforter.   -It's a blanket. Just a blanket.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.87,0:29:55.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什像我们这样的人 得要知道羽绒被是什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do guys like us know what a duvet is?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.38,0:29:59.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我们过著原始人的生活 那是我们生存所需的知识\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this essential to our survival in the hunter-gatherer sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.80,0:30:01.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.59,0:30:05.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一所以我们算什 一我不知道 消费者吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What are we, then?   -I dunno. Consumers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.05,0:30:08.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我们就是消费者\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. We're consumers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.26,0:30:11.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是时尚生活方式的产物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are by-products of a lifestyle obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.18,0:30:15.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谋杀 犯罪 困 这些事情与我无关\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Murder, crime, poverty. These things don't concern me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.73,0:30:18.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只关心名人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What concerns me are celebrity magazines,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.07,0:30:21.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}500个频道的电视\N{\rEN\blur0.8}television with 500 channels,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.53,0:30:23.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我内裤的牌子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}some guy's name on my underwear.
