Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.88,0:32:52.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的行话把那叫做香烟焦痕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the industry, we call them cigarette burns.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.80,0:32:54.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是换下一卷的记号\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the cue for a changeover.
