Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.81,0:37:51.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个月后 我竟然不想念电视\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the end of the first month, I didn't miss TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.44,0:37:55.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}甚至不在乎潮热 变味的冰箱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't even mind the warm, Stale refrigerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.87,0:38:10.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下一个可以换我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I be next?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.88,0:38:16.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 老兄\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.46,0:38:18.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}脱掉领带\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lose the tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.68,0:38:26.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在夜里 我和泰勒周遭一公里之内都没有人烟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At night, Tyler and I were alone for half a mile in every direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.89,0:38:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雨水不断徙缝滴漏下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rain trickled down through the plaster and the light fixtures.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.48,0:38:39.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}木制的家具不膨收缩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything wooden swelled and shrank.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.19,0:38:42.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}生的子都跑了出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everywhere were rusted nails to snag your elbow on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.99,0:38:46.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以前的住户一定是孤僻的离群索居\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The previous occupant had been a bit of a shut-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.28,0:38:48.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你在读什？  -你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What are you reading?   -Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.62,0:38:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是用人体器官作第一人写的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's an article written by an organ in the first person.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.16,0:38:54.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“我是克的脊髓”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"lam Jack's medulla oblongata."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.58,0:38:56.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“没有了我 克就不能调节\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Without me, Jack could not regulate
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.42,0:38:59.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的胀搏 、血压和呼吸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"his heart rate, blood pressure or breathing."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.13,0:39:01.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有很多\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a whole series of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.34,0:39:05.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是吉儿的乳头 我是克的结肠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"I Am Jill's Nipples." "I Am Jack's Colon."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.76,0:39:08.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对 “我得了癌症 ，会害死克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. "I Get Cancer. I Kill Jack."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.10,0:39:12.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoop! Agh!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.10,0:39:16.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每次打架后 周围的一切声音就会减弱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After fighting, everything else in life got the volume turned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.73,0:39:19.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什鹰？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.77,0:39:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}－什事情都迎刃而解 一报告写完了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You could deal with anything.   -Have you finished those reports?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.32,0:39:30.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你可以和任何人打架 你最想和打？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}\f you could choose, who would you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.16,0:39:33.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或许是我老吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd fight my boss, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.29,0:39:34.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.46,0:39:38.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-对 为什间 ？你呢？  -我想跟我爸打\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah. Why? Who would you fight?   -I'd fight my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.13,0:39:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不识我爸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.96,0:39:44.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当然知道他是 但是当我六时，他就离开 了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I know him, but he left when I was, like, six years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.72,0:39:47.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}娶了另一个女人 生了另外的孩子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Married this other woman and had some other kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.34,0:39:49.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他每六年就重来一次\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He did this every six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.30,0:39:53.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一换个新城市 成立个新家 一这混蛋开起连锁店 了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He moves city and starts a new family.   -Fucker's setting up franchises.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.85,0:39:59.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸没上过大学 所以我读大学就很重要了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My dad never went to college, so it was real important that I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.81,0:40:01.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}起来很老套\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That sounds familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.32,0:40:05.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我事业后 打长途电话给他 我 爸 现在呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I graduate. I call him up long distance and say, "Dad, now what?"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.24,0:40:07.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一他 找工作啊” 一我也一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He says, "Get a job."   -Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.49,0:40:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我25，我每年打一次电话给他 我 爸 现在呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now I'm 25. Make my yearly call again. "Dad, now what?"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.37,0:40:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他 ：不知道 结婚吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He says, "I dunno. Get married."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.96,0:40:18.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能结婚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.25,0:40:21.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是30岁的小男孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a 30-year-old boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.38,0:40:24.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这些男人是被女人飬大的一代\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're a generation of men raised by women.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.55,0:40:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很怀疑另外一个女人 会是我们寻求的答案\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm wondering if another woman is really the answer we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.14,0:40:37.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大多数时候 我俩互相照顾\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Most of the week, we were Ozzie and Harriet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.69,0:40:42.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是每到星期六晚上 我们都会发现更多事物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But every Saturday night, we were finding something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.15,0:40:46.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发现越多 就越证明 自 己不孤独\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We were finding out more and more that we were not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.53,0:40:54.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以前要是带著忿怒或者沮丧回家 我就打公寓\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It used to be that when I came home angry or depressed, I'd just clean my condo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.74,0:40:57.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯堪的纳维亚家具打\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Polish my Scandinavian furniture.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.46,0:40:59.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我早该另觅公寓\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I should have been looking for a new condo,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.87,0:41:02.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找保险公司理赔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}haggling with my insurance company.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.54,0:41:07.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本应对被烧毁的精制优雅的家 感到难过 可是我没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I should have been upset about my nice flaming little shit - but I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.67,0:41:11.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}公司网络的基本前提是 事情更有效率\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The premise of cybernetting an office is make things more efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.64,0:41:14.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}星期一早上 我能做的就是期待下一调的来临\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Monday mornings, all I thought about was next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.97,0:41:17.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}图标用矢车菊蓝的好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I get the icon in cornflower blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.93,0:41:19.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.73,0:41:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最重要的是效率\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Efficiency is priority No.1, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.56,0:41:24.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为浪费就是盗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because waste is a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.65,0:41:29.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经给他看过了 你喜欢吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I showed this to my man here. You liked it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.74,0:41:36.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人可以喝下一品脱的血还不会匾吐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can swallow a pint of blood before you get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.66,0:41:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个人都知道 我和泰勒只不过把它付实际\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was right in everyone's face. Tyler and I just made it visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.92,0:41:46.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个人都知道 我和泰勒只不过它命名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was on the tip of everyone's tongue. Tyler and I just gave it a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.60,0:42:00.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点 各位 回家了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, people, you've gotta go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.91,0:42:24.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关掉音乐 把后门锁上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn off the jukebox. Lock the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.27,0:42:49.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每调 泰勒都复述我俩订的规则\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every week, Tyler gave the rules that he and I decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.82,0:42:51.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.90,0:42:53.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎来到门阵俱乐部\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to Fight Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.41,0:43:00.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}门阵俱乐部第一条规则是 不能论门阵俱乐部\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The first rule of Fight Club is you do not talk about Fight Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.16,0:43:03.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罔阵俱乐部第二条规则是·\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The second rule of Fight Club is...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.83,0:43:06.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不能谈论门阵俱乐部 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you do not talk about Fight Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.67,0:43:09.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罔阵俱乐部第三条规则\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Third rule of Fight Club:
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.17,0:43:12.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要有人喊停 受伤 或者累死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}someone yells stop, goes limp, taps out,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.76,0:43:14.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打门就得停止\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the fight is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.80,0:43:17.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第四条规则 一次只能雨个人打\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fourth rule: only two guys to a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.14,0:43:20.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第五条 一场一场地打\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fifth rule: one fight at a time, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.35,0:43:24.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第六条：脱掉衫和鞋子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sixth rule: no shirts, no shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.35,0:43:29.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第七条：打门没有时限\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seventh rule: fights will go on as long as they have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.82,0:43:37.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第八条 也是最后一条 如果你是初次参加\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the eighth and final rule: if this is your first night at Fight Club,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.28,0:43:39.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就一定得打开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.33,0:43:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瓣公室的小弟李奇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This kid from work, Ricky,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.16,0:43:50.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上班时什事都记不住 比如墨水是蓝色还是黑 色\N{\rEN\blur0.8}couldn't remember whether you ordered pens with blue ink or black.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.71,0:43:53.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他打门时就像天神一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Ricky was a god for ten minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.71,0:43:57.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当他痛撃餐厅领班时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when he trounced the maitre d' of a local food court.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.55,0:44:01.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时，价 你只能到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes, all you could hear were the flat,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.26,0:44:04.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}单调 沉重的擎打声 混合著呐喊声\N{\rEN\blur0.8}hard, packing sounds over the yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.77,0:44:10.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者有人室息的呼吸 血的喷射……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or the wet choke when someone gasped and sprayed...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.02,0:44:12.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.78,0:44:15.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在那里 你才真正的活了过来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You weren't alive anywhere like you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.53,0:44:20.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阵俱乐部只有在打门的时候才存在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Fight Club only exists in the hours between when Fight Club starts and ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.45,0:44:23.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就算是我为一个人打得很棒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even if I could tell someone they had a good fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.91,0:44:26.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}遇见他时我也不会告他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wouldn't be talking to the same man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.37,0:44:27.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在门阵俱乐部的你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who you were in Fight Club
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.79,0:44:30.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与其他地方的你不是同一个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is not who you were in the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.75,0:44:35.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚来门阵俱乐部的人 上都是光滑圆润的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A guy came to Fight Club for the first time. His ass was a wad of cookie dough.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.17,0:44:38.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}调之后 就像雕刻过的木头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After a few weeks, he was carved out of wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.09,0:44:42.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果可以和任何名人打门 你选选？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you could fight any celebrity, who would you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.10,0:44:45.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一活的还是死的 一都可以 最顽强\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Alive or dead?   -Doesn't matter. Who'd be tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.31,0:44:48.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海明威 你呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hemingway. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.06,0:44:53.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要跟星迷航的盘长打\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shainer. I'd fight William Shatner.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.03,0:44:57.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们开始有不同点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We all started seeing things differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.53,0:45:01.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管到哪 我们都会品头足\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everywhere we went, we were sizing things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.95,0:45:08.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得上健身房的人真可悲\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I felt sorry for guys packed into gyms,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.58,0:45:12.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}努力自 己看起来 像名牌商的那样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}trying to look like how Calvin Klein or Tommy Hilfiger said they should.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.71,0:45:15.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是男人应该有的样子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that what a man looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.59,0:45:18.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自我成长要靠手淫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, self-improvement is masturbation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.72,0:45:20.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以及自我毁……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, self-destruction...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.01,0:45:22.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}借过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.59,0:46:00.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}门阵俱乐部不在乎输赢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fight Club wasn't about winning or losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.26,0:46:02.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也不需要言语\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It wasn't about words.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.84,0:46:09.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正的呐喊声留在嘴里 像圣灵降临教派一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The hysterical shouting was in tongues, like at a Pentecostal Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.73,0:46:16.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不行了？  -停\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Is that it?   -Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.98,0:46:19.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打门结束后 没什遗留问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When the fight was over, nothing was solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.36,0:46:22.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都无关紧要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But nothing mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.11,0:46:23.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酷\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.57,0:46:28.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打过之后 如被救一般\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Afterwards, we all felt saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.16,0:46:30.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 老兄 下调再来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, man. How about next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.66,0:46:33.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下个月再来吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about next month?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.92,0:46:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欧文 到中间来 新来的 也过来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Irvine, you're in the middle. New guy, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.55,0:46:41.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候泰勒会代替我话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes, Tyler spoke for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.55,0:46:43.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他楼梯上摔下来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He fell down some stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.18,0:46:46.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我楼梯上摔下来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I fell down some stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.43,0:46:52.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}门阵俱乐部成为剪头髪 或者修指甲的原因\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fight Club became the reason to cut your hair short or trim your fingernails.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.89,0:46:54.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}历史人物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}OK. Any historical figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.98,0:46:59.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}－我要跟甘地打 一答得好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'd fight Gandhi.   -Good answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.61,0:47:02.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你呢 -林肯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How about you?   -Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.94,0:47:04.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-林肯？  -嗯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Lincoln?   -Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.20,0:47:08.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}身材高大手长长 削瘦的家伙会打到快死才停\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Big guy, big reach. Skinny guys fight till they're burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.20,0:47:10.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}靠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.70,0:47:15.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 就算蒙娜丽莎也会褪色\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, even the Mona Lisa's falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.38,0:47:25.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.47,0:47:28.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这八个礼拜 你到哪儿去了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where have you been the last eight weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.39,0:47:30.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛拉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marla?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.02,0:47:36.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你怎找到我的 一你在答录机上留的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How did you find me?   -You left a forwarding number.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.19,0:47:38.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都没在自助团体中看到你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't seen you at any support groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.11,0:47:42.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我们平分了 好的 记得？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We split 'em up. That was the idea. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.48,0:47:45.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，可 可是你也没去上你的课啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but you haven't been going to yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.53,0:47:47.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你怎知道？  -我没守信用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How do you know?   -I cheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.37,0:47:51.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我找到新的寄托\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I found a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.33,0:47:53.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一真的 一只有男人可以参加\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Really?   -It's for men only.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.66,0:47:55.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟睾丸癌一样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like the testicle thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.33,0:47:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Whah!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.75,0:48:03.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一著 我现在没时间 一我参加了购物狂团体\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Look, this is a bad time.   -I've been going to Debtors Anonymous.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.42,0:48:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你想看看毫无希望的人？  -我要出门\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Some really fucked-up people.   -I'm on my way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.47,0:48:09.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也要走了 我吃了好多安眠药\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me too. I've got a stomach full of Xanax.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.64,0:48:13.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把瓶子里的通通吃光了 可能吃太多 了吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I took what was left of a bottle. It might have been too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.72,0:48:17.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想像著玛拉辛格 在自 己廉价公寓里匾吐的样子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Picture Marla Singer throwing herself around her crummy apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.81,0:48:21.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这不是一个真正的 自杀事件 也许是个电话求助事件吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This isn't a for-real suicide. It's probably a cry for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.23,0:48:23.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可以持续好个小时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This could go on for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.90,0:48:28.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-所以你今晚会在家？  -你想不想我描述死亡经过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-SO you're staying in tonight?   -Do you wanna hear me describe death?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.99,0:48:33.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想不想知道我的鬼魂会不会讲电话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you wanna listen and see if my spirit can use a phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.25,0:48:37.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以前过临死前喉的咯咯声？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you ever heard a death rattle before?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.69,0:49:05.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒的门关著\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler's door was closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.86,0:49:09.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这雨个月来 他的门没关过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd been here for two months and his door was never closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.04,0:49:17.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会相信我昨天晚上做的梦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You won't believe the dream I had last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.54,0:49:20.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不敢相信昨晚发生的任何事情\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can hardly believe anything from last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.55,0:49:32.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎会在这？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.39,0:49:37.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一什 一这是我家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -This is my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.93,0:49:39.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎会在我家？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.06,0:49:43.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}操你妈的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.54,0:50:01.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，依 你的朋友真好斡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you've got some fucked-up friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.88,0:50:05.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又柔软又有弹性\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Limber, though. Silly cooze.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.63,0:50:11.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我昨晚看到电话没 想看是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I come in last night. Phone's off the hook. Guess who's on the other end.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.63,0:50:14.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用他 我就知道经过了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I knew the story before he told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.60,0:50:20.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以前过临死前喉的咯咯声？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you ever heard a death rattle before?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.81,0:50:23.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为它像别人的那样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think it'll live up to its name?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.85,0:50:26.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是只是干咳？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or will it just be a death hairball?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.03,0:50:33.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}备咳走灵魂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Prepare to evacuate soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.11,0:50:38.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十、九\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ten, nine, eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.95,0:50:42.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什泰勒为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How could Tyler, of all people, think it was a bad thing
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.21,0:50:44.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛拉辛格的死是一件事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that Marla Singer was about to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.25,0:50:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五 四 三……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...five, four, three...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.26,0:50:51.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.72,0:50:58.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来得真快\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got here fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.31,0:51:03.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有打给你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did I call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.27,0:51:05.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.65,0:51:16.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}床罩太滑了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The mattress is all sealed in slippery plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.41,0:51:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别心 那束西跟你没得比\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry. It's not a threat to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.46,0:51:29.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢 他妈的 有人报警了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, fuck! Somebody called the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.26,0:51:44.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘿 513号在哪里？  -最后一间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey, where's 513?   -End of the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.60,0:51:49.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住那儿的女孩 本来是个迷人可爱的女孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The girl who lives there used to be a charming, lovely girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.19,0:51:51.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是她失去了 自信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She has lost faith in herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.40,0:51:54.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一辛格小姐 我们你 一她是个怪物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Miss Singer, let us help you!   -She's a monsier!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.24,0:51:58.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你不可以死 一她是个航的人渣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You have every reason to live.   -She's infectious human waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.53,0:52:01.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一辛格小姐 一祝你们能救到她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Miss Singer!   -Good luck trying to save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.88,0:52:11.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是我睡著就死定了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I fall asleep, I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.09,0:52:15.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你必我保持清醒……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna have to keep me up...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.05,0:52:17.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一整夜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.14,0:52:20.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太他妈的不可思了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Un-fucking-believable.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.55,0:52:22.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他对可以承受\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was obviously able to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.47,0:52:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你也知道的 你也跟她搞过 一不 我没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You know what I! mean. You fucked her.   -No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.39,0:52:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-没有？  -没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Never?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.48,0:52:33.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你对她没兴趣 一没有 天啊 完全没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're not into her, are you?   -No! God, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.15,0:52:36.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是克气疯了的膀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am Jack's raging bile duct.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.40,0:52:39.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一真的 ？告我没关系 －相信我 确实没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you sure? You can tell me.   -Believe me, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.07,0:52:41.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿把枪对著我的头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put a gun to my head
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.41,0:52:43.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}－然后把我的脑打到上吧 一很好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-and spray my brains.   -That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.74,0:52:46.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她其实是凶悍的野兽假扮成一个宠物 离她远一点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a predator posing as a house pet. Stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.92,0:52:52.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那女的话粗野 我来没过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The shit that came out of this woman's mouth, I had never heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.75,0:52:54.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.30,0:52:57.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我小学事业后就没干得这爽过了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't been fucked like that since grade school.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.84,0:53:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一哦 －泰勒怎会不喜欢这种人呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Euch!   -How could Tyler not go for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.64,0:53:03.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他上次还把大屌剪接进 “灰姑娘” 里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The other night, he was splicing sex organs into "Cinderella".
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.06,0:53:06.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛拉不需要情人 她需要社工\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Marla doesn't need a lover, just a caseworker.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.48,0:53:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟洗衣店 这不是爱 这是床上运动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And a wash. This isn't love, it's sport fucking.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.06,0:53:13.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她先是入我的 自助团体 现在又入我家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She invaded my support groups and now my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.15,0:53:15.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 嘿 坐下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey. Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.36,0:53:23.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}－你不能跟她谈我的事 一我干嘛要跟她话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I can't have you talking to her about me.   -Why would I talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.32,0:53:25.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你敢跟她或任何人关于我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You say anything about me or what goes on
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.20,0:53:28.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或这间房子的任何事情 我们就交\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in this house to her or anybody, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.33,0:53:31.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一对我发誓 一好吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Now promise me.   -OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.62,0:53:33.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你发誓？  -我发誓\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You promise?   -I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.29,0:53:36.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一发誓 －我刚刚了我发誓\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Promise.   -I just said, I promise! What...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.21,0:53:38.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你发了三次誓\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's three times you promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.76,0:53:43.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}若我当时浪费分钟等玛拉辛格死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If only I had wasted a couple of minutes and gone to watch Marla Singer die,
