Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.90,0:54:45.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一不 谢谢 一我找到香烟了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No. No, thank you.   -I found a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.58,0:54:50.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你在跟话？  -闲嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Who were you talking to?   -Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.87,0:54:54.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我变成世界里安静的角落\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I became the calm little center of the world.
