Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.26,0:55:03.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我开始写句\N{\rEN\blur0.8}! wrote little haiku poems.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.05,0:55:06.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用电子邮件传给别人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I emailed them to everyone.
