Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.78,0:55:26.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个人的上都带著 “对 这些是打架后的瘀青\N{\rEN\blur0.8}/ got right in everyone's hostile face. "Yes, these are bruises from fighting."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.95,0:55:30.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错 我很喜欢这个样子 我受到 了启发\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Yes, I'm comfortable with that.! am enlightened."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.16,0:55:37.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放公寓和时尚生活 放全部烧毁的财产\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You give up the condo life and all your flaming worldly possessions,
