Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.88,0:55:44.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……回家还要面对这些\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and you have to come home fo this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.85,0:55:56.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.94,0:56:00.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是火组的史丹警探\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Detective Stern with the Arson Unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.57,0:56:04.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你公寓的事 我们有了新线索\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have new information about the incident at your former condo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.61,0:56:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一是 一不知道你是否意识到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes?   -I don't Know if you're aware,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.49,0:56:10.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人在你的门上了氟氯烷\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but someone sprayed Freon into your front-door lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.62,0:56:13.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后用鳖子敲打引起火花\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They used a chisel to shatter the cylinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.62,0:56:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一不 我一点都不知道 一我是克的冷汗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, I wasn't aware of that.   -I am Jack's cold sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.46,0:56:21.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你觉得奇怪？  -是 非常奇怪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Does this sound strange to you?   -Yes, sir. Very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.00,0:56:23.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这种炸药……  -炸药？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The dynamite...   -Dynamite?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.63,0:56:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}·在现场残留有铵酸钾氯化盐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...left a residue of ammonium oxalate potassium perchloride.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.22,0:56:31.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-知道那是什意思？  -不知道 是什意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do you know what this means?   -No. What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.80,0:56:33.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}表示那是自制的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It means it was home-made.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.60,0:56:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起 ，辽 这对我来非常震 ，先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. This is just coming as quite a shock to me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.60,0:56:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无论安置这种自制炸药 都可能你的炉火\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoever set this dynamite could have blown out
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.65,0:56:43.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在爆炸之前天就爆炸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}your pilot light days before the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.65,0:56:46.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一瓦斯只是引爆器 一是做的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The gas was just a detonator.   -Who'd do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.57,0:56:48.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一由我发问 一告他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'll ask the questions.   -Tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.49,0:56:53.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}破我财产的解放者 拯救了我的生活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"The liberator who destroyed my property realigned my perceptions."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.41,0:56:54.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不好意思 你在？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me. Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.95,0:56:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是 只是很难理解为什有人这干\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. It's hard to know what to make of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.54,0:57:00.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和什人有仇？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you recently made enemies
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.67,0:57:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚且还会自制炸药？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who might have access to home-made dynamite?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.96,0:57:05.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一人？ 我拒一切文明\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Enemies?   -"I reject civilization,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.63,0:57:07.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“特别是物质财富’\N{\rEN\blur0.8}especially material possessions."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.72,0:57:10.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这件事很严 一是 我知道很严\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Son, this is serious.   -Yes, I know it's serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.43,0:57:13.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我是真的 一是 非常严\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-! mean that.   -Yes, it's very serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.35,0:57:19.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人比我对这件事更加真 那间公寓等于我的生命 好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, nobody takes this more seriously than me. That condo was my life. OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.69,0:57:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}里面每样家具都是我的最爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I loved every stick of furniture in that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.48,0:57:25.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被毁的不只是冷冰冰的束西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was not just a bunch of stuff that got destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.78,0:57:28.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一是我这个人 －我真要好好感谢大学教育\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It was me!   -I thank the Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.36,0:57:32.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你现在不方便讨这件事？  -就他妈的告他是你干的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-ls this not a good time for you?   -Just tell him you fucking did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.87,0:57:36.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告他是你炸掉的 那就是他想要的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell him you blew it all up! That's what he wants to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.04,0:57:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你还在 一等等 你为我是嫌犯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you still there?   -Wait. Are you saying that I'm a suspect?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.00,0:57:45.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我们只是需要再谈 若你要出远门 记得告我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I may need to talk to you, so you let me know if you're gonna leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.46,0:57:48.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好 ？  -好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-OK?   -OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.51,0:57:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了做爱的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Except for their humping,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.72,0:57:55.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒和玛拉不在同一个房里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler and Marla were never in the same room.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.64,0:57:58.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸妈也曾这样好多年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My parents pulled this exact same act for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.39,0:58:01.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保套是我们现代人的玻璃鞋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The condom is the glass slipper of our generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.73,0:58:05.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}遇到陌生人时就戴上一个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You slip one on when you meet a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.73,0:58:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跳了整晚的舞之后 就把那玩意丢掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You dance all night, then you throw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.44,0:58:13.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丢安全套 ，> 不是丢陌生人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The condom, I mean. Not the stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.57,0:58:16.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什鹰？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.50,0:58:23.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我花一块买下这件礼服\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got this dress at a thrift store for $1.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.42,0:58:25.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一分一分货\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was worth every penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.29,0:58:27.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是件伴娘礼服\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a bridesmaid's dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.38,0:58:33.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这件衣服只会被珍惜一天时间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone loved it intensely for one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.55,0:58:36.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后就被扔了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then tossed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.76,0:58:39.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就好像圣证树\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like a Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.14,0:58:42.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本来很特别的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So special.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.98,0:58:44.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后·！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then... bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.81,0:58:48.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就被丢路旁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's on the side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.57,0:58:50.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连包装都还没拆呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tinsel still clinging to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.65,0:58:59.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像被杀的受害者一样 内裤反穿 还被黑胶带起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like a sex-crime victim, underwear inside out, bound with electrical tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.95,0:59:02.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 那这件衣服很适合你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, then, it suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.46,0:59:04.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以借你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can borrow it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.80,0:59:13.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}提她走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get rid of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.13,0:59:16.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一什？你自 己起她走 一别提到我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What? You get rid of her!   -Don't mention me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.80,0:59:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我又回到六 在父母之间传信息\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am six years old again, passing messages between parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.39,0:59:27.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我为你该走了 一不要心 我正要走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's time you left.   -Don't worry, I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.23,0:59:32.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一亚非我们不喜欢你来 一你是个疯子 我真的受不了你了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Not that we don't love your visits.   -You are such a nutcase. I can't keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.90,0:59:36.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gotta get off
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.49,0:59:37.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，再见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.57,0:59:42.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得离开这个是非之地\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gotta get off of this merry-go-round
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.71,0:59:49.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得离开 得离开、得离开……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gonna get, need to get, gotta get...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.01,0:59:54.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小孩子气！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.72,0:59:58.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什要在她身上浪费时间？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do you still waste time with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.85,1:00:02.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会这玛拉 至少她努力达到极限\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll say this about Marla. At least she's trying to hit bottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.06,1:00:04.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm not?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.81,1:00:08.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在屁股上插羽毛 不等于你就变成了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sticking feathers up your butt does not make you a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.86,1:00:10.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚要干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are we doing tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.82,1:00:12.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚……我们做肥皂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tonight... we make soap.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.98,1:00:17.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-真的？  -为了制造肥皂 要先提炼脂肪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Really?   -To make soap, first we render fat.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.55,1:00:38.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}盐的份量必须正确\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The salt balance has to be just right,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.05,1:00:42.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最好的脂肪是人体脂肪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so the best fat for soap comes from humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.89,1:00:46.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-等等 这是哪里？  -抽脂诊所\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Wait. What is this place?   -A liposuction clinic.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.94,1:00:55.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊哈 发财了 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aha! Pay dirt!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.57,1:01:00.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全世界最有养分 最油的脂肪 无与偷比\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Richest, creamiest fat in the world. The fat of the land!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.08,1:01:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 别扯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! Don't pull it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.63,1:01:16.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一噢 天啊 一再给我一包\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, God!   -Give me another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.39,1:01:27.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}提炼脂肪时 动物油脂就会浮上来 跟童子军时学的一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As the fat renders, the tallows float to the surface. Like in Boy Scouts.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.18,1:01:31.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我能想像你当童子军的样子 一续拌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's hard to imagine you as a Boy Scout.   -Keep stirring.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.15,1:01:37.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一旦脂肪变硬 除去表面的甘油\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Once the tallow hardens, you skim off a layer of glycerin.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.78,1:01:40.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加上硝酸后 就燮成硝化甘油\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Add nitric acid, you got nitroglycerin.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.11,1:01:44.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再加上硝酸 以及少量木屑 就可以做成炸药\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you then add sodium nitrate and sawdust, you got dynamite.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.33,1:01:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有足的肥皂 我们就可以炸掉任何东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With enough soap, one could blow up anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.16,1:01:50.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒知道很多有用的知识\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler was full of useful information.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.92,1:01:54.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}古人知道在小溪的哪段洗衣服最干净\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ancient peoples found clothes got cleaner when washed in one part of the river.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.46,1:01:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-知道为什？  -不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You know why?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.05,1:02:02.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们以前在河的山丘上用人作祭品\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Humans were once sacrificed on the hills above.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.97,1:02:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}燃烧屁体 水冲刷灰 会产生液\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bodies burned, water seeped through the ashes to create lye.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.22,1:02:09.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是液 决定性的成分\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is lye. The crucial ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.31,1:02:13.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一旦混合了屁体融化的脂肪 就能排出肥皂的成份进入小溪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Once it mixed with the melted body fat, a soapy discharge crept into the river.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.94,1:02:16.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以看看你的手？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May I see your hand, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.28,1:02:24.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.70,1:02:27.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一这是化学烧伤 一啊 啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This is a chemical burn.   -Agh! Aaagh!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.58,1:02:30.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比其他灼伤都要痛 而且会留下疤痕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll hurt more than you've ever been burned and leave a scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.00,1:02:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果冥想能治疗癌症 也能治疗这个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If meditation worked for cancer, it could work for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.17,1:02:37.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一感受一下这种疼痛 不要扎 一噢 天啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't shut the pain out.   -Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.59,1:02:40.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最早的肥皂是用英雄的灰做的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The first soap was made from heroes' ashes,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.63,1:02:42.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像第一上太空的猴子一样伟大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like the first monkey shot into space.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.51,1:02:45.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果没有痛苦 没有牲 我们就什都没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Without pain or sacrifice, we would have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.72,1:02:48.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我试著不去想 灼伤 或 肉体 这些词\N{\rEN\blur0.8}/ tried not to think of the words "searing" or "flesh".
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.56,1:02:51.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别动 这是你的牲 这是你烧伤的手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it! This is your pain, this is your burning hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.56,1:02:54.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要去我的洞穴 我要去找我的力量动物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going to my cave to find my power animal.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.73,1:02:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 不要用那些要死的人的方式 躲避疼痛 来呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! Don't deal with this the way those dead people do! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.36,1:02:59.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我懂了 一不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I get the point!   -No!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.57,1:03:01.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你感觉到的只是最初的启示\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're feeling premature enlightenment.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.37,1:03:09.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你一生中最伟大的时刻 老兄 你的心思跑哪儿去了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the greatest moment of your life, and you're missing it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.24,1:03:10.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}lam not...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.37,1:03:14.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闲嘴 我们的父亲就像神的原型\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut up! Our fathers were our models for God.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.37,1:03:17.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连父亲都抛我们 更何沉神？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If our fathers bailed, what does that tell you about God?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.71,1:03:24.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}著 你必假设神不爱你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen to me. You have to consider the possibility that God does not like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.18,1:03:27.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不卷顾你 很可能恨你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He never wanted you. In all probability, he hates you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.89,1:03:31.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}痛苦不是最悲惨的事 我们不需要他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is not the worst thing that can happen. We don't need him!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.39,1:03:34.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我同意 一去他妈的咒 去他妈的罪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I agree!   -Fuck damnation, fuck redemption.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.64,1:03:37.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都是被神遗的子民？接受吧 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are God's unwanted children? So be it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.23,1:03:41.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我要水 一你可以冲水镶烧伤更严重 或者……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm getting water!   -You can use water and make it worse or...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.28,1:03:42.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看著我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.90,1:03:46.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一或者用醋来中和 一请我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Or use vinegar to neutralize the burn.   -Please let me have it, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.11,1:03:48.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先你必须放\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First, you have to give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.74,1:03:51.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你必须知道 不是恐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First, you have to know - not fear -
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.49,1:03:54.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}面对你总有一天会死的事实\N{\rEN\blur0.8}know that someday, you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.46,1:03:56.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不知道这有多痛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't know how this feels!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.63,1:04:05.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有放一切 我们才能获得自 由\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's only after we've lost everything that we're free to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.43,1:04:08.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.11,1:04:26.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恭喜你 你越来越接近极限了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Congratulations. You're one step closer to hitting bottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.87,1:04:33.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒把肥皂卖给百货公司 每块20元\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler sold his soap to department stores at $20 a bar.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.62,1:04:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天晓得他们卖多少\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God knows what they charged.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.20,1:04:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一这是最好的肥皂 －为什 谢谢 苏珊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This is the best soap.   -Why, thank you, Susan.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.46,1:04:41.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这真不错……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.09,1:04:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把那些富有女人 自 己的脂肪卖回给她们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We were selling rich women their own fat asses back to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.34,1:04:48.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他今天打黄色领带\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was wearing his yellow tie.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.47,1:04:50.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在根本不打领带了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't even wear a tie to work anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.80,1:04:54.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“们阵俱乐部的第一条规则 就是不能们阵俱乐部”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"The first rule of Fight Club is don't talk about Fight Club"?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.64,1:04:57.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我又昏头了 一定是把原稿忘在影印机上了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm half-asleep again. I must have left it in the copy machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.02,1:05:00.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}们阵俱乐部的第二条规则…… 这是你的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"The second rule..." Is this yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.06,1:05:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.48,1:05:05.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}假设你是我 你来做决定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pretend you're me. Make a managerial decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.65,1:05:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果是你找到这个 你会怎辨？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You find this. What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.03,1:05:14.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯 我来告你吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I gotta tell you,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.12,1:05:18.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会非常 非常小心地跟那个人交谈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd be very, very careful who you talk to about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.50,1:05:21.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为写那些的人一定很危\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because the person who wrote that is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.04,1:05:26.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个人面怪兽 恐怕会大发雷霆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And this button-down, Oxford-cloth psycho might just snap
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.59,1:05:29.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大每一间瓣公室\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then stalk from office to office
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.55,1:05:34.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会拿著半自动卡寳步枪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with an Armalite AR10 carbine gas-powered semiautomatic weapon,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.06,1:05:38.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}逐个杀光他周围所有的同事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}pumping round after round into colleagues and co-workers.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.35,1:05:43.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个人可能是你的老朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This might be someone you've known for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.40,1:05:46.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟你非常亲近的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone very, very close to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.48,1:05:50.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些都是泰勒会的话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler's words coming out of my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.61,1:05:53.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以前的我是个好好先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I used to be such a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.62,1:05:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要每次到什就来我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or maybe you shouldn't bring me every piece of trash you pick up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.71,1:06:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一服务部 －我的奶子快掉了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Compliance and Liability.   -My tit's gonna rot off.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.88,1:06:08.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失陪了 我得接个电话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you excuse me? I need to take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.18,1:06:15.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.30,1:06:18.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你替我查是否长了乳癌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to check for a lump in my breast.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.39,1:06:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-去医院啊 一我没去看医生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Go to a hospital.   -I can't afford to waste money on a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.94,1:06:25.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我又不懂这个 玛拉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know about this, Marla.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.40,1:06:26.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.90,1:06:30.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她没找泰勒 因为我对她不会起邪念\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She didn't call Tyler. I'm neutral in her book.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.53,1:06:36.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不错嘛 拿食物给…… 哈尼佛跟雷恩太太？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's nice. Taking food to... Mrs. Haniver and Mrs. Raines.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.87,1:06:38.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们在哪里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are they, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.74,1:06:43.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很不幸 都死了 我然活著 很 要吃？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tragically, they're dead. I'm alive and I'm in poverty. Want any?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.42,1:06:45.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一不 一我替你留了一份\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, no.   -I got one for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.34,1:06:47.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你的好意\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks for the thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.59,1:06:50.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的手怎了 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened to your hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.22,1:06:52.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，没什鹰\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.05,1:06:56.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这里？  -嗯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Right there?   -Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.60,1:06:59.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一有没有什 一没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Feel anything?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.14,1:07:00.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再确定一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, make sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.14,1:07:05.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一好 我很肯定 一你什都没摸到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-OK, I'm pretty sure.   -You feel nothing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.44,1:07:08.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有 什都没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.61,1:07:12.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就放心 了 谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's a relief. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.86,1:07:17.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一没什 一我希望有机会报答你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No problem.   -I wish I could return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.12,1:07:19.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的家族没有人得过乳癌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Breast cancer doesn't run in my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.58,1:07:22.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我可以替你查前列腺 一我为我问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I could check your prostate.   -I think I'm OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.29,1:07:25.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不如何 很感谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, thanks, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.00,1:07:32.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一好了 -对 好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are we done?   -Yeah, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.46,1:07:34.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See you... around.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.82,1:07:53.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}柯纳里斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cornelius?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.86,1:07:56.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}柯纳里斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cornelius!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.53,1:07:58.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我 伯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's me! Bob!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.99,1:08:00.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂 伯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.46,1:08:07.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我们还以为你死了呢 一不 不 我还活著\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We all thought you were dead.   -No, no. Still here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.67,1:08:09.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伯 你好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How are you, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.67,1:08:11.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比任何时候都好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Better than I've ever been in my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.46,1:08:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的 还在参加存的男人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? Still Remaining Men Together?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.51,1:08:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 不 我找到了更好的寄托\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no. I got something so much better now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.63,1:08:19.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？是什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.47,1:08:21.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.43,1:08:25.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一条规则是 我不能它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The first rule is, I'm not supposed to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.44,1:08:27.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二条规则是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the second rule is...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.06,1:08:29.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不可以谈它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not supposed to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.81,1:08:33.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-第三条规则是……  -伯 伯 我也是会员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-And the third rule is...   -Bob, Bob. I'm a member.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.36,1:08:36.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伯 看我的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at my face, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.36,1:08:40.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他妈的太好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's fucking great.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.74,1:08:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我没见过你啊 一我只有星期二和星期四去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I've never seen you there.   -I go Tuesdays and Thursdays.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.04,1:08:48.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我星期六去 一恭喜你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I go Saturday.   -Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.00,1:08:50.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 嘿 恭喜我们雨个吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, hey, to both of us, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.88,1:08:53.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道发起人是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you heard about the guy that invented it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.00,1:08:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-知道 实际上……  -我了好多传闻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah, actually...   -I hear all kinds of things.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.80,1:09:01.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人他是在精神病院出生的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Supposedly, he was born in a mental institution
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.10,1:09:04.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚且他一个晚上只睡一小时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and he sleeps only one hour a night.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.89,1:09:07.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一他是个伟人 一噢……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He's a great man.   -Oh...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.89,1:09:10.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你识泰勒德顿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know about Tyler Durden?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.42,1:09:37.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没打疼你吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't hurt you, did I?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.63,1:09:40.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实际上 你有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.26,1:09:43.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你 谢谢你 谢谢 谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you for this. Thank you, thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.93,1:09:46.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}门阵俱乐部\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fight Club.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.47,1:09:48.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我和泰勒共同创建的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This was mine and Tyler's gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.94,1:09:50.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我们给世界的礼物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our gift to the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.77,1:09:54.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}四处看看 我发现有很多新面孔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I look around, I look around, I see a lot of new faces.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.19,1:09:57.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闲嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.94,1:10:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这表示你们很多人 一直没遵守前雨条规则\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which means a lot of people have been breaking the first two rules of Fight Club.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.16,1:10:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在们阵俱乐部里 看到 了最强最聪明的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see in Fight Club the strongest and smartest men who've ever lived.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.96,1:10:19.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见你们的力 都被浪费了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see all this potential. And I see it squandered.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.22,1:10:24.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的 只能在加油站打工\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goddamn it, an entire generation pumping gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.64,1:10:26.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做服务生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Waiting tables.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.51,1:10:28.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}白领奴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slaves with white collars.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.14,1:10:34.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}广告诱惑我们买车子跟衣服\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Advertising has us chasing cars and clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.15,1:10:37.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}于是拼命工作买些你不需要的东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Working jobs we hate so we can buy shit we don't need.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.32,1:10:45.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是被历史遗忘的一代 没有 目 的 没有地位\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're the middle children of history, men. No purpose or place.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.49,1:10:48.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有世界大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have no Great War.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.66,1:10:50.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有大条\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No Great Depression.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.37,1:10:55.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的大只是心灵之\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our great war is a spiritual war.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.38,1:10:58.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的大条就是生活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our great depression is our lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.51,1:11:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们小看电视相信有一天 我们都会成为百万富翁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've all been raised on TV to believe that one day we'd be millionaires
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.93,1:11:08.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}电影明星或摇滚巨星\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and movie gods and rock stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.39,1:11:10.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们不会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.39,1:11:13.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我们逐渐面对著的现实\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're slowly learning that fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.44,1:11:16.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我们非常 非常愤怒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we're very, very pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.44,1:11:18.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.03,1:11:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}门阵俱乐部第一条规则 你不能谈论……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First rule of Fight Club is, do not talk...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.33,1:11:32.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.37,1:11:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我是？  -对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Who am I?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.21,1:11:39.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在前面有一个招牌写著匾氏酒吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a sign on the front that says Lou's Tavern.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.80,1:11:44.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是他妈的 你他妈的又是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm fucking Lou. Who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.22,1:11:45.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒德顿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler Durden.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.85,1:11:51.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他妈的告你们可以用我的地方？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who told you motherfuckers you could use my place?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.85,1:11:54.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们跟欧文达成了协\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have a deal worked out with Irvine.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.94,1:11:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他现在正在家里疗伤 这又不是他的店 是我的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Irvine's at home with a broken collarbone. He don't own this place. I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.32,1:12:05.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你们给他多少？  -一分都没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How much money does he get?   -There is no money.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.32,1:12:07.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一真的 -通通免费\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Really?   -Free to all.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.16,1:12:10.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-真神奇 -没\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ain't that something.   -It is, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.41,1:12:12.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}著 他妈的笨蛋 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, stupid fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.54,1:12:17.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我要你们现在通通滚出去 一嘿 你也该加入我们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I want everybody out of here right now.   -Hey! You should join our club.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.67,1:12:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-到我刚刚什？  -你跟你的朋友都可以加入\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Did you hear what I just said?   -You and your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.22,1:12:27.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在到了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You hear me now?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.43,1:12:30.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我没懂 ，匾\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I didn't quite catch that, Lou.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.14,1:12:39.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是不懂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Still not getting it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.02,1:12:41.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 好 我懂了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Agh! OK, OK, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.82,1:12:44.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我懂了 我懂了 靠 我又忘了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got it, I got it. Shit, I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.78,1:12:47.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后 ！ 都退后 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Back! All of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.86,1:12:50.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通通退后\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody back!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.50,1:13:00.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊 虚！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, Lou!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.00,1:13:04.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样 老兄 我们真的喜欢这个地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, man! We really like this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.14,1:13:16.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一就是这样 续发浅吧 一他妈的闲嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's right, Lou. Get it out.   -Shut the fuck up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.81,1:13:18.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，爽 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.98,1:13:25.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他妈的很有趣？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's fucking funny?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.37,1:13:37.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这家伙疯了 我告你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fucking guy's a loony, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.16,1:13:39.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难以相信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.34,1:13:47.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你不知道我的极限在哪 ，  -我的天啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You don't know where I've been, Lou.   -Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.88,1:13:50.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不知道我的极限\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't know where I've been!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.51,1:13:56.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}！ 我们续用它吧 ，求你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please let us keep it, Lou! Please, Lou!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.52,1:14:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一要用就用吧 天啊 一向我保证 ，！ 向我保证\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Fucking use the basement! Christ!   -I want your word, Lou! I want your word!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.60,1:14:03.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用我妈的名发誓\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On my mother's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.03,1:14:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}虚 谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks, Lou.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.79,1:14:18.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也是 大个儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You too, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.58,1:14:24.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下调见了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll see you next week.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.23,1:14:43.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个礼拜你们每个人 都有家庭作业\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This week, each one of you has a homework assignment.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.19,1:14:49.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们必须出去 找一个陌生人 打一场架\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna go out. You're gonna start a fight with a total stranger.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.07,1:14:54.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你必须打一场架\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna start a fight,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.78,1:14:56.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你必打输\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.41,1:15:01.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}眼光不错 先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excellent choice, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.92,1:15:05.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 当心 你这混蛋 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Watch out, jackass! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.92,1:15:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这份作业亚不像起来那样简单\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, this is not as easy as it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.84,1:15:13.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什……狗娘养的 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What... Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.01,1:15:18.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大多数人 正常的人 都会量避免打架\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Most people - normal people - do just about anything to avoid a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.18,1:15:21.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不好意思 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.77,1:15:24.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚才喷到我了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sprayed me with your hose.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.10,1:15:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不需要这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.69,1:15:27.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快打电话报警 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay! Go call 911!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.19,1:15:31.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把水管放下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put the hose down.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.11,1:15:34.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手 住手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.24,1:15:38.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.29,1:15:47.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这混蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.63,1:15:55.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们需要谈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.97,1:15:59.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.10,1:16:02.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}何起？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where to begin?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.48,1:16:05.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈你经常请假的事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With your constant absenteeism?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.14,1:16:08.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是你仪容不整的事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With your unpresentable appearance?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.15,1:16:12.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一马上就要年度考核了 一我是克的一点也不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're up for review.   -I am Jack's complete lack of surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.94,1:16:14.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一什 一我们做个假设\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -Let's pretend.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.99,1:16:17.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}假设你是交通部的人 好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the Department of Transportation, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.49,1:16:23.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当有人跟你在作撞撃测试时 前排座位的支撑架什的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone informs you that this company installs front-seat mounting brackets
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.70,1:16:25.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有通过验\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that never pass collision tests,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.92,1:16:29.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行超过1500公里时 刹车就会掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}brake linings that fail after 1,000 miles,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.17,1:16:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}燃油喷射系统会爆炸烧死人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and fuel injectors that explode and burn people alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.51,1:16:36.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会怎辨？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What then?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.47,1:16:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你在威我？  -不……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you threatening me?   -No...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.89,1:16:42.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一他妈的出去 你被开除了 一我有个更好的解决瓣法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Get the fuck out of here. You're fired!   -I have a better solution.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.68,1:16:45.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把我转成外聘人员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep me on the payroll as an outside consultant
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.27,1:16:47.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要付我薪水就行了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and, in exchange for my salary,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.85,1:16:51.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就不把这些事出去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my job will be never to tell people these things that I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.65,1:16:57.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我甚至不需要进瓣公室 在家工作就行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't even have to come into the office. I can do this job from home.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.36,1:17:01.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你他妈的以为你是？ 你疯了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who... Who the fuck do you think you are, you Crazy little shit?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.33,1:17:10.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一警卫 一我是克的报复神经\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Security!   -/ am Jack's smirking revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.67,1:17:18.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Agh!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.51,1:17:21.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你他妈的在干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.44,1:17:32.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好痛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.44,1:17:36.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什要打我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.78,1:17:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢 天啊 不 请住手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God! No! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.92,1:17:51.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.25,1:17:54.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，天啊 不 ！ 求你 ！ 不 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God, no! Please! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.42,1:17:57.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道为什 我想起我第一次和泰勒打架\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For some reason, I thought of my first fight, with Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.30,1:17:59.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.53,1:18:29.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}里到外彻彻底底 这家伙的所作所为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Under and behind and inside everything this man took for granted,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.25,1:18:32.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所累的怒气都成长了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}something horrible had been growing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.62,1:18:36.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}著 你只要付我薪水就行了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look. Just give me the paychecks, like I asked,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.21,1:18:38.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会再出现的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you won't ever see me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.63,1:18:41.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我跟他在一起最棒的时刻……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And right then, at our most excellent moment together...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.51,1:18:48.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢天谢地 请不要再打我了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank God! Please don't hit me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.31,1:18:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}电话 电脑 ，传真机\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Telephone, computer, fax machine,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.68,1:18:54.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}52张薪水支票 还有48张机票折价券\N{\rEN\blur0.8}52 weekly paychecks and 48 airline flight coupons.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.98,1:18:57.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们现在有赞助商了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We now had corporate sponsorship.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.57,1:19:01.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是泰勒和我能每天都去 门阵俱乐部的原因\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is how Tyler and I were able to have Fight Club every night of the week.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.07,1:19:08.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}门阵俱乐部里 没有人是主角 除了在场上打架的雨个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, nobody was the center of Fight Club except the two men fighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.20,1:19:12.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}导的行非常低调\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The leader walked through the crowd, out in the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.17,1:19:17.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒被普若斯曼大饭店起了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler was now involved in a lawsuit with the Pressman Hotel
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.71,1:19:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为他在汤里撒尿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}over the urine content of their soup.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.14,1:19:28.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是克的人生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am Jack's wasted life.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.65,1:19:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.69,1:19:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒设计了新的作业\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler dreamed up new homework assignments.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.40,1:19:46.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}装在封好的信封里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He handed them out in sealed envelopes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.38,1:20:06.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.51,1:20:08.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以用回收机油来灌溉草地
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.30,1:20:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}环境保护员
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.82,1:20:28.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一德拉威也有个门阵俱乐部 一对啊 我了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-There's a Fight Club in Delaware City.   -Yeah, I heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.74,1:20:35.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}潘葛福好像也有 伯在纽卡索也发现一个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's one in Penns Grove too. Bob even found one up in New Castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.41,1:20:38.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一那是你成立的 一不 我还以为是你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Did you start that one?   -No, I thought you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.21,1:20:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.78,1:21:11.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警方扣押粪便投器
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.66,1:21:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}艺术表演
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.66,1:21:17.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当地购物中心停电 喷水池受污染
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.87,1:21:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失猴子遭悌毛被寻回
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.22,1:21:32.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一停一下 一我们要干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Stop.   -What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.14,1:21:33.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一转过去 一我们要干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Turn around.   -What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.93,1:21:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一家庭作业 一哪一种\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Homework assignment.   -What kind?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.64,1:21:38.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}活人祭品\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Human sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.69,1:21:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一那是枪？请告我那不是枪 一是枪 到后面去等我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-ls that a gun? Please tell me it's not.   -It's a gun. Meet me in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.61,1:21:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一不要了 一到后面去等我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't fuck around!   -Meet me in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.98,1:21:49.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在一定的时间内\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On a long enough time line,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.32,1:21:51.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个人的生存率都会超近于零\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the survival rate for everyone drops to zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.41,1:21:56.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-住手 你在干嘛？  -把手放到后面\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Stop. What are you doing?   -Hands behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.04,1:21:58.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}皮爽给我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.58,1:22:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雷蒙凯艾索 1320具宁街A室\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Raymond K Hessel. 1320 SE Banning, Apartment A.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.04,1:22:05.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小小的地下室公寓？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cramped basement apartment?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.75,1:22:09.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你怎知道？  -地方的地址只有字母 没有数字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How did you know?   -They give shitty apartments letters.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.05,1:22:13.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雷蒙 ！ 你要死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Raymond! You're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.18,1:22:14.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.47,1:22:16.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你父母？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that your mom and dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.81,1:22:19.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父母必打电话请医生 找出牙齿治疗资料\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're gonna have to call the kindly doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.39,1:22:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才能辨出你的身分 你知道为什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pick up your dental records. Know why?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.60,1:22:24.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一因为我要打爆你的 一别这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-There'll be nothing left of your face.   -Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.36,1:22:29.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过期的社区大学学生证 雷蒙 你读什的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An expired community college student ID. What did you study, Raymond?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.03,1:22:32.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一标……标本 一棵本？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-S... Stuff.   -Stuff?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.61,1:22:34.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}期中考难？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Were the midterms hard?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.83,1:22:38.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我问你学什 一大多跟生物有关\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I asked you what you studied!   -Biology, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.62,1:22:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-为什？  -我不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why?   -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.83,1:22:44.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雷蒙凯艾索 你想要成为什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you wanna be, Raymond K Hessel?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.30,1:22:50.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雷蒙 我问你 你想要成为什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The question, Raymond, was: what did you want to be?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.43,1:22:53.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雷蒙 回答他 ！ 天啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Answer him, Raymond! Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.93,1:22:56.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一默医 默医 一动物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Veterinarian. Veterinarian.   -Animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.56,1:22:59.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一是的 动物标本 一标本 对 我懂了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah. Animal and stuff.   -Stuff. Yeah, I got that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.31,1:23:02.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一那表示你还要念很多书 一太多书了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-SO you need more schooling.   -Too much school.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.56,1:23:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一那你情死 一不 拜……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Would you rather be dead?   -No, please...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.60,1:23:08.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你宁死在便利商店的后门？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'd rather die here, on your knees, in the back of a convenience store?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.78,1:23:11.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 拜 不要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Please, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.70,1:23:17.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要拿走你的驾照\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm keeping your license.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.24,1:23:21.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我随时会去看你 我知道你住哪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gonna check in on you. I know where you live.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.54,1:23:25.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是在六个星期内你还没有备当默医\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you're not on your way to being a veterinarian in six weeks,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.33,1:23:27.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就死定了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you will be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.21,1:23:31.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在跑回家吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now run on home.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.64,1:23:37.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跑 阿甘 跑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Run, Forrest, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.14,1:23:40.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有罪恶感\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel ill.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.81,1:23:45.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一想像一下他的感受 一拜 这一点都不好玩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Imagine how he feels.   -Come on, this isn't funny!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.06,1:23:49.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那他妈的有什意义？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the fuck was the point of that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.36,1:23:53.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天将是雷蒙凯艾索 一生中最美的一天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tomorrow will be the most beautiful day of Raymond K Hessel's life.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.11,1:23:57.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的早餐会比你我 吃过的任何东西都香\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His breakfast will taste better than any meal you and I have ever tasted.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.82,1:24:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不得不佩服他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You had to give it to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.41,1:24:03.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一走吧 一他早有计划\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on.   -He had a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.54,1:24:06.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚且它开始实现了 用一种泰勒的方式\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it started to make sense in a Tyler sort of way.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.92,1:24:10.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抛恐 抛享乐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No fear. No distractions.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.30,1:24:14.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不在乎失去一切 才有自 由\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The ability to let that which does not matter truly slide.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.81,1:24:29.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}工作不能代表你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are not your job.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.94,1:24:34.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}银行存款不能代表你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not how much money you have in the bank.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.90,1:24:39.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你开的车也不能代表你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not the car you drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.58,1:24:42.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}皮爽里的束西不能代表你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not the contents of your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.45,1:24:46.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}衣服也不能代表你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not your fucking khakis.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.67,1:24:50.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只是平凡生中的其中一个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are the all-singing, all-dancing crap of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.05,1:25:02.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上就走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be out of your way in a sec.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.31,1:25:05.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不必离开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.81,1:25:08.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随便\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.60,1:25:13.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我是……关系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I mean... It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.58,1:25:24.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还有参加自助团体？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you still going to groups?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.79,1:25:27.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.08,1:25:30.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克洛伊死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chloe's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.04,1:25:32.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇 克洛伊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. Chloe.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.13,1:25:36.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什鹰时候的事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.55,1:25:38.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在乎？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you care?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.97,1:25:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道 很久没想到她了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I dunno. I haven't thought about it in a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.93,1:25:43.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.26,1:25:46.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或许她死了也好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was the smart move on her part.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.85,1:25:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}著 嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.23,1:25:53.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这样做有什好处？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you getting out of all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.02,1:25:55.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什鹰？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.23,1:25:59.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是 所有这些 你为什一直……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, all this. Why do you keep...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.32,1:26:01.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样做会你开心？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this making you happy?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.24,1:26:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.08,1:26:08.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道 我不懂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.75,1:26:14.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什弱的人 总想有强的人作依靠？为什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why does a weaker person need to latch on to a strong person? What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.92,1:26:16.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你又得到了什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you get out of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.92,1:26:23.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不……这是雨回事 我们的情况完全不同\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No... That's not the same thing at all. It's totally different with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.72,1:26:25.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Us"?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.81,1:26:29.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们 是什意思？ 一不好意思 你有到？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What do you mean by "us"?   -I'm sorry. Do you hear this?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.56,1:26:32.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一到什 一那些噪音 等等\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hear what?   -All that noise. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.48,1:26:35.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 等等 别改变话题 我得跟你好好谈谈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, wait! Don't change the subject! I want to talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.98,1:26:38.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你们没有在我吧？  -没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're not talking about me, are you?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.86,1:26:42.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一什 一你那天来我家救我 那是怎回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -You playing doctor. What was going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.53,1:26:45.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你们在谈什 一没什 没什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What are you talking about?   -Nothing. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.66,1:26:47.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我想不是吧 一你到底想怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I don't think so.   -What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.74,1:26:49.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一看著我 一不 什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Look at me.   -No. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.62,1:26:54.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一那是什 一没什 别在意\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What is that?   -It's nothing. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.46,1:26:57.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我的天啊 弄的 ？  -一个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-My God. Who did this?   -A person.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.50,1:26:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}男的还是女的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guy or girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.96,1:27:01.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你管他是男的还是女的 一你干嘛不我问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What do you care?   -What do you care if I ask?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.68,1:27:03.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一别管我 一你不敢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Leave me alone.   -You're afraid to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.38,1:27:06.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我不怕 放开我 一不 告我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I am not. Let me go.   -No! Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.18,1:27:07.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开我 走开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let go of me. Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.06,1:27:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这次谈话……  -这次谈话……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This conversation...   -This conversation...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.14,1:27:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一……结束了 一……结束了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...1S Over.   -...1S Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.65,1:27:17.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是没法讨好你 对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just can't win with you, can I?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.53,1:27:28.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 这样太老套了吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, this is getting a little old!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.91,1:27:31.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是……这是怎回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is... What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.75,1:27:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.92,1:27:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 我们要双层床干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, why do we need bunk beds?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.00,1:27:38.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.97,1:27:48.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太年轻 抱歉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too young. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.89,1:27:51.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's all that?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.56,1:27:55.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}若应微的人年轻 就他们太年轻 老的太老 胖的太胖\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell the applicant if he's too young, too old or too fat.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.23,1:27:56.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}应微的人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Applicant?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.52,1:28:00.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果他能忍受三天三夜 没有食品 没有遮蔽物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If the applicant waits three days without food or shelter,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.19,1:28:02.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才可以进来，开始训\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he may enter and begin training.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.74,1:28:04.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}训什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Training for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.16,1:28:12.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为这是游？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think this is a game?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.12,1:28:14.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太年轻了 不能接受训\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're too young to train here, end of story.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.46,1:28:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别浪费我们的时间 快他妈的滚开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quit wasting our time. Get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.67,1:28:24.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}消息 朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bad news, friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.47,1:28:27.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是不可能的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.18,1:28:29.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你必须要了解\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry if there was a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.22,1:28:32.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这又不是世界末日 走就是了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not the end of the world. Just... go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.98,1:28:35.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.02,1:28:39.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这是擅民宅 我会报警\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're trespassing and I will have to call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.40,1:28:47.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别瞪著我 你永远也不可能进来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you look at me! You're never getting in this fucking house!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.03,1:28:51.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可能 不要站在走廊上 快走开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never. Now get the fuck off my porch! Get off my porch!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.45,1:28:54.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们早都会成为泰勒所期望的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sooner or later, we all became what Tyler wanted us to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.70,1:28:57.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要去拿子来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna go inside and I'm gonna get a shovel.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.76,1:29:09.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有雨件黑褪衫？ 两条黑子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got two black shirts? Two pair of black pants?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.68,1:29:12.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一是 长官 －一双黑靴子？ 黑薇子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes, Sir.   -One pair black boots? Black socks?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.76,1:29:14.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一长官 －一件黑外套？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Sir.   -One black jacket?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.31,1:29:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一长官 -三百块葬仪费\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Sir.   -$300 personal burial money?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.60,1:29:18.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是 ，长长官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.48,1:29:22.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.62,1:29:34.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太老了 肥仔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're too old, fat man.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.45,1:29:38.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的奶子太大了 别站在我走廊上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your tits are too big. Get the fuck off my porch.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.09,1:29:47.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伯 伯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bob! Bob!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.82,1:30:07.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像备进入太空的猴子一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like a monkey ready to be shot into space.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.19,1:30:08.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太空猴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Space monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.36,1:30:12.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}备牲自 己换取突破\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ready to sacrifice himself for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.33,1:30:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你他妈的太老了 ，肥仔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are too fucking old, fatty!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.37,1:30:26.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有你你他妈的头发太黄了 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you... You're too fucking blond!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.34,1:30:28.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出去 ，你们雨个 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of here, the both of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.42,1:30:30.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一直这样持续下去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And so it went.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.84,1:30:33.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}注意著 你们这群蛆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen up, maggots.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.30,1:30:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不是什特别的人物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are not special.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.68,1:30:38.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不是一片美丽或者独特的雪花\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are not a beautiful or unique snowflake.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.68,1:30:42.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟其他生物一样衰败\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are the same decaying organic matter as everything else.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.73,1:30:45.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒组了一支军\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler built himself an army.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.98,1:30:50.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只是来这世界走一遭了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are the all-singing, all-dancing crap of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.28,1:30:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟其他生物没什鹰雨样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are all part of the same compost heap.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.53,1:30:58.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒德顿为什要组军隧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why was Tyler Durden building an army?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.37,1:31:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有什目的？ 用意是好还是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To what purpose? For what greater good?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.71,1:31:07.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们完全信任泰勒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In Tyler we trusted.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.22,1:31:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当他 工作不代表你 我就 对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When he was like, "You are not your job," I was like, "Yeah!"
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.60,1:31:22.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这是什？  -嘿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey, what's all this?   -Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.44,1:31:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}OK!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.52,1:31:29.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这是怎回事？  -我们在祝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's going on?   -We're celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.69,1:31:31.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一庆祝什 －快点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What are we celebrating?   -Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.49,1:31:38.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘿 一我来拿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey.   -Let me get that for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.33,1:31:46.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一样的好口味 百事可乐 下一个世代\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Same great taste. Pepsi. Generation Next.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.58,1:31:49.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘘 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.17,1:31:54.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警方已经来到现场 警察署长刚刚到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Investigators are on the scene. The Police Commissioner has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.97,1:31:58.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能否请你 这里发生了什事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could you tell us what you think has happened here?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.35,1:32:02.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们相信很多这些 在城市周发生的破行动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We believe this is one of many recent acts of vandalism around the city
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.35,1:32:05.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都与一个地下拳擎社团有关\N{\rEN\blur0.8}somehow related to underground boxing clubs.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.10,1:32:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们将展开专案调查行动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We will be coordinating a rigorous investigation.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.36,1:32:13.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是雅各署长的谈话 他刚刚来到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was Commissioner Jacobs who just arrived on the scene
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.61,1:32:19.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这个四级火炎现场……  -她好辣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-of a four-alarm fire that broke out...   -She's hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.37,1:32:21.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现场交还给摄影棚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Back to you in the studio.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.74,1:32:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一耶 一耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah!   -Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.83,1:32:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我的天啊 一耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Holy shit!   -Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.76,1:32:36.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们做了什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the fuck did you guys do?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.43,1:32:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是火调查……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Arson investigators are on the premises...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.14,1:32:49.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生 破计划的第一条规则是 不可以提问 先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, the first rule of Project Mayhem is you do not ask questions, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.65,1:32:59.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对付犯罪不能有一点拖延\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The victory in the war against crime will not come overnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.74,1:33:04.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}需要各位的持和忠诚 最重要的 是合作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It will take dedication and commitment and, most of all, cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.45,1:33:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}街道现在更安全了 市区秩序有了希望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Streets are safer now. There is hope in the inner city.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.42,1:33:11.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-然而……  -我要上所\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-However...   -I gotta take a piss.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.17,1:33:15.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这只是第一步 还有很漫长的路程\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These are the first steps in a long journey.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.72,1:33:17.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是为什 要设置希望计画……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is why we have created Project Hope...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.22,1:33:18.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bob.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.64,1:33:21.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……它所涵盖的围是全面性的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...helping others with prevention and enforcement.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.68,1:33:24.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望计画需要大家的合作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Project Hope will be a joint effort
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.97,1:33:27.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是警方或是地方政府\N{\rEN\blur0.8}between the police and community leaders.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.02,1:33:31.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是对抗犯罪的 一个强而有力的新武器\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It will be a powerful new weapon in the war against crime.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.61,1:34:23.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一把他的蛋捆起来 一他的蛋真冰凉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Wrap it around the top of his Hacky Sack.   -Man! His balls are ice-cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.91,1:34:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你必须取消专案调查计画\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. You're gonna call off your rigorous investigation.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.12,1:34:29.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开个记者会 宣怖没有什地下组织\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You will publicly state there is no underground group
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.96,1:34:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}否则他们会割掉你的卵蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or these guys are gonna take your balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.58,1:34:38.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一颗送到 纽约时报 一颗送到 洛杉时报\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They'll send one to the New York Times and one to the LA Times.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.34,1:34:42.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要追查的人 都是你所依靠的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, the people you are after are the people you depend on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.14,1:34:46.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们替你煮饭，替你倒垃圾 替你接电话线\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We cook your meals. We haul your trash. We connect your calls.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.26,1:34:49.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}替你开救护车 你睡觉时，替你守门\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We drive your ambulances. We guard you while you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.44,1:34:56.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别他妈的我们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not fuck with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.87,1:35:07.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下一次就是蛋了 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ball check!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.13,1:35:23.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伯 这\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bob, this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.89,1:35:26.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.56,1:35:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是克的彻底反感\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am Jack's inflamed sense of rejection.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.06,1:35:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.78,1:35:49.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.57,1:36:26.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想要把不肯做爱的熊都杀光\N{\rEN\blur0.8}/ felt like putting a bullet in every panda that wouldn't screw to save its species.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.87,1:36:32.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想要打开油桶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wanted to open the dump valves on oil tankers
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.70,1:36:35.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用污油污染法国的海 然我从未去过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and smother all those French beaches I'd never see.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.25,1:36:42.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想要呼吸混的空气\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wanted to breathe smoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.40,1:37:01.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要去哪？神经病？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you go, psycho boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.15,1:37:06.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想破一切美丽的东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I felt like destroying something beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.24,1:37:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一送他去医院 一好的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Get him to a fucking hospital.   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.76,1:37:28.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德顿先生 不要心 机场的车可以寄放很久\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry, Mr. Durden. Airport parking. Long term.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.26,1:37:31.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先，德顿先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After you, Mr. Durden.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.51,1:37:34.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先请\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.23,1:37:41.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回收你的动物
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.87,1:37:54.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-有什心事 亲爱的 ？  -没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Something on your mind, dear?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.74,1:37:57.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 为什不告我破计画呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Why wasn't I told about Project Mayhem?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.58,1:38:01.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}破计画第一条规则是不能提问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First rule of Project Mayhem is you do not ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.63,1:38:05.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-为什不一开始就我参与？  -门阵俱乐部就是开始\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why wasn't I included in the beginning?   -Fight Club was the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.30,1:38:08.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经地下室里走出来了 改名为破计画\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now it's left the basements and it's Project Mayhem.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.59,1:38:11.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们共同创建了门阵俱乐部 记得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We started Fight Club together. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.55,1:38:13.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它既是你的也是我的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's as much mine as it is yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.43,1:38:17.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你为这是我俩的 一是啊 我俩合作创建的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Is this about you and me?   -Yeah. Weren't we doing this together?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.52,1:38:19.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不是我们的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This does not belong to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.73,1:38:22.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我们不特别 一去你的 你应该先告我的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We are not special.   -Fuck that. You should have told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.48,1:38:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 泰勒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Tyler!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.24,1:38:30.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一他妈的 泰勒 一你要什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Goddamn it, Tyler!   -What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.40,1:38:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}计划书？我应该发电子邮件？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A statement of purpose? Should I email you?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.70,1:38:36.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-著……  -要不要加入是你 自 己决定的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Look...   -You decide your level of involvement!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.41,1:38:38.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要！ 我要知道细节\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will! I wanna know certain things first!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.75,1:38:41.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-破计画第一条规则……  -闲嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The first rule of Project Mayhem...   -Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.00,1:38:46.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我要知道你在想什 一管他想什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I wanna know what you're thinking.   -Fuck what you know!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.34,1:38:50.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你应该忘记你想知道什 忘记生活 忘记友谊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Forget about what you think you know about life, friendship,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.68,1:38:53.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特别是忘记你和我的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and especially about you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.43,1:38:57.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什意思？什……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is that supposed to mean? What...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.52,1:39:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.23,1:39:05.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们在死前想做什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What'll you wish you'd done before you die?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.27,1:39:07.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一画幅自画像 一建一栋房子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Paint a self-portrait.   -Build a house.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.23,1:39:10.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你呢 一我不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-And you?   -I don't know. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.86,1:39:13.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一看好路 一你必须知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Get in the right lane.   -You have to know!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.20,1:39:15.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}若你现在就死 你对生命有何感受？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you died now, how would you feel about your life?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.08,1:39:20.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道 我觉得生命乏善可陈 我这样你高兴了吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know! Nothing good. Is that what you want to hear me say?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.54,1:39:22.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一别这样 一不好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on!   -Not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.37,1:39:24.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别他妈的搞 泰勒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop fucking around! Tyler!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.67,1:39:29.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天啊 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.38,1:39:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可恶 可！ 去你妈的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goddamn it! Goddamn it! Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.88,1:39:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去他妈的门阵俱乐部 去他妈的玛拉 我受不了你了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck Fight Club. Fuck Marla! I am sick of all your shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.26,1:39:39.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 好吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}OK, man. OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.18,1:39:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一别再瞎搞 握好方向盘 一看看你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Quit screwing around. Steer!   -Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.56,1:39:45.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一握好方向盘 一看看你 你真他妈的可悲\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Steer!   -Look at you! You're fucking pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.81,1:39:50.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-为什？为什？你在什？  -你想我干嘛要炸毁你的公寓\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why? Why? What are you talking about?   -Why do you think I blew up your condo?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.44,1:39:52.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什鹰？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.74,1:39:56.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}躲到 自助围体 不能解决一切问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hitting bottom isn't a weekend retreat. It's not a goddamn seminar.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.24,1:40:00.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别再企图控制一切 应该放一切\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop trying to control everything and just let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.50,1:40:05.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一放 一好 好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let go!   -All right. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.38,1:40:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.69,1:41:10.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没出过车福\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd never been in a car accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.32,1:41:13.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我替那些车褐算出数目之前\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This must have been what all those people felt like
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.48,1:41:16.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些受难者一定也经受过这样的痛苦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}before I filed them as Statistics in my reports.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.40,1:41:19.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可恶！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.78,1:41:25.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是濒死体验\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've just had a near-life experience!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.79,1:41:35.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我眼中的世界 你在洛克斐勒中心的墟附近\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the world I see, you're stalking elk through the Grand Canyon forests
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.76,1:41:38.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿过大峡谷偷偷靠近舵鹿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}around the ruins of Rockefeller Center.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.60,1:41:45.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你穿的皮革衣服一子都不会壤\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll wear leather clothes that will last you the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.39,1:41:49.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爬上西尔斯公司的塔顶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll climb the thick kudzu vines that wrap the Sears Tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.65,1:41:54.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当你往下看 看著密密麻麻的小生物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And when you look down, you'll see tiny figures pounding corn,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.15,1:41:56.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}躺在的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}laying strips of venison
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.48,1:42:00.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}空荡荡地高速公路上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the empty car-pool lane of some abandoned superhighway.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.71,1:42:15.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好好照顾你自\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Feel better, champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.90,1:42:35.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.40,1:42:36.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.90,1:42:38.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……泰勒走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... lyler was gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.04,1:42:48.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我睡著了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Was I asleep?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.54,1:42:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有睡过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Had I slept?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.00,1:42:54.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不是一片美丽或者独特的雪花……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are not a beautiful, unique snowflake...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.63,1:42:57.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}房子已经成为了有生命的束西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The house had become a living thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.76,1:43:01.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这多人在里面 出汗和呼吸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}wet inside from so many people sweating and breathing.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.18,1:43:02.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只是平凡生中的一员……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are all part of the same compost heap...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.84,1:43:06.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那多人在动 房子也在动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So many people moving, the house moved.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.14,1:43:10.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒星球\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Planet Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.10,1:43:14.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只能面对空 困在这太空猴中间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had to hug the walls, trapped inside this clockwork of space monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.11,1:43:18.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能在这里抽烟 你知道这里有多少毒气？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't be smoking! You know how much ether is in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.36,1:43:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}煮饭，工作 睡觉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cooking and working and sleeping in teams.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.45,1:43:26.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.89,1:43:48.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都在控制当中 ，长官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's under control, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.64,1:43:52.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's Tyler?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.27,1:43:55.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长官 破计画的第一条规则是你不能……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, the first rule of Project Mayhem is you do not...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.15,1:43:57.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，好吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.65,1:44:01.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我变孤独了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm all alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.74,1:44:05.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我父亲下我 泰勒也抛下我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father dumped me. Tyler dumped me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.70,1:44:07.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是克破碎的心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am Jack's broken heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.29,1:44:15.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}破计画下一步是什 只有泰勒知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What comes next in Project Mayhem only Tyler knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.67,1:44:19.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二条规则是你不能提问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The second rule is you do not ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.80,1:44:25.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我滚开 给我滚开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get the fuck away from me! Get the fuck away!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.55,1:44:28.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些人是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who are all these people?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.27,1:44:35.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}佩柏街肥皂公司的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Paper Street Soap Company.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.06,1:44:40.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以进去？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I come in?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.86,1:44:44.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不在这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.15,1:44:46.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什鹰？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.86,1:44:50.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒不在这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.87,1:44:53.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler went away.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.95,1:44:55.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.85,1:45:14.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊！ 快找人来忙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus! Get some help!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.57,1:45:30.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他中了两枪 快他妈开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two gunshot wounds coming through! Make some fucking room!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.62,1:45:32.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎回事？怎回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.74,1:45:34.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们去执行一项任务\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We were on assignment.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.12,1:45:37.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一石二鸟的任务\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We were supposed to kill two birds with one stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.37,1:45:39.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毁掉一件艺术品·\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Destroy a piece of corporate art...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.96,1:45:42.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿铁闪电行动开始 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Operation Latte Thunder. Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.92,1:45:46.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}·顺便毁掉一个连锁咖啡店\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and trash a franchise coffee bar.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.43,1:45:54.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全部都按计划执行著 ，长官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We had it all worked out, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.82,1:46:06.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-本来都很顺利的 直到……  -警察 别动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It went smooth until...   -Police! Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.24,1:46:09.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什？  -他们对伯开枪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -They shot Bob.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.61,1:46:13.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-射中 了他的头 一他妈的杂种\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-They shot him in the head.   -Fucking pigs!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.37,1:46:20.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗅 天啊 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.12,1:46:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一那些狗娘养的 一你们这些白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Those motherfuckers!   -You morons.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.46,1:46:27.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们到处跑去破壤 到处爆炸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You run around in ski masks trying to blow things up?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.51,1:46:30.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还希望有什下场？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you think was gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.30,1:46:36.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快 我们要销毁证据 要把体处理掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}OK, quick! We gotta get rid of the evidence - his body!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.02,1:46:39.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}－埋起来 一什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bury him.   -What?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.27,1:46:41.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他拿到后花园埋起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take him to the garden and bury him.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.56,1:46:46.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一快点 我们走 一走开 别动他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on, people, let's go!   -Get the fuck off! Get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.86,1:46:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.32,1:46:51.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不是他妈的什证据 他是个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This isn't fucking evidence. This is a person.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.32,1:46:54.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是我的朋友 不准你们把他埋在他妈的后花园里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's my friend and you're not burying him in the garden!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.45,1:46:57.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在破计划中殉职 长官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was killed serving Project Mayhem, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.24,1:47:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一他是伯 一但是 ，长官 在……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This is Bob.   -But, sir, in...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.16,1:47:02.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}破计画中 我们都没有名字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In Project Mayhem, we have no names.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.50,1:47:03.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 ，你我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.92,1:47:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个人 他有名字 他叫做罗伯宝森\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a man and he has a name, and it's Robert Paulsen, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.50,1:47:09.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗伯宝森？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Robert Paulsen?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.67,1:47:12.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个人 现在死了 因我们而死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a man, and he's dead now because of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.09,1:47:13.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们懂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.01,1:47:16.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我懂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.77,1:47:23.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}死了之后 破计画的成员就有名字了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In death, a member of Project Mayhem has a name.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.98,1:47:27.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的名字是罗伯宝森\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His name is Robert Paulsen.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.86,1:47:29.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的名字是罗伯宝森\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His name is Robert Paulsen.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.61,1:47:33.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的名字……是罗伯宝森\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His name... is Robert Paulsen.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.45,1:47:37.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的名字是罗伯宝森\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His name is Robert Paulsen.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.20,1:47:40.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一拜 别这样 一他的名字是罗伯宝森\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on, guys. Please. Stop it.   -His name is Robert Paulsen.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.00,1:47:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闲嘴 全都闲嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut up! This is all over with!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.74,1:48:15.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德顿/泰勒 洛杉－芝加哥
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.07,1:48:17.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}逹拉斯 亚特兰大
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.16,1:48:18.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}登机证
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.24,1:48:22.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.37,1:48:24.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我是火组的史顿警探\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, this is Detective Stern of the Arson Unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.08,1:48:26.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要请你到局里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to see you...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.17,1:48:35.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我根据泰勒留下的票根 去他到过的每个地方的酒吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I went to all the cities on Tyler's used ticket stubs, bar-hopping.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.01,1:48:37.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道该怎做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know how,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.43,1:48:40.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看到了50个不同的酒吧 但我知道就是那个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I could look at 50 different bars, and somehow I just knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.60,1:48:45.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要找泰勒德顿 我一定要跟他谈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm looking for Tyler Durden. It's very important that I talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.23,1:48:47.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也希望我能到你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wish I could help you,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.40,1:48:48.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.78,1:48:56.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管我到什地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every city I went to,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.78,1:49:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要我一下飞机\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as soon as I set foot off the plane,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.32,1:49:02.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就能感觉附近有门阵俱乐部\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I knew a Fight Club was close.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.33,1:49:05.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂 ！ 喂 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.62,1:49:06.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}计程车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.96,1:49:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看我的 我也是会员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at my face. I'm a member.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.50,1:49:11.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想知道你是否见过泰勒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, I just need to know if you've seen Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.80,1:49:15.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能把任何与此有关的信息告你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not exposed to bespeak any such information to you,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.51,1:49:19.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者告我 即使我知道 你想要哪些信息 即使\N{\rEN\blur0.8}nor would I, even if I had said information at this juncture, be able.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.97,1:49:24.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你是个白 一恐怕我必要请你离开 了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're a moron.   -I'm gonna have to ask you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.14,1:49:31.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒一直很忙碌 忙著在全国设立连锁店\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler had been busy, setting up franchises all over the country.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.03,1:49:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在睡觉？ 我有睡过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Was I asleep? Had I slept?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.45,1:49:41.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒是我的梦魔 还是我是他的梦魔？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is Tyler my bad dream, or am I Tyler's?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.16,1:49:44.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我只知道一个传 一什传？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We've just heard the stories.   -What stories?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.62,1:49:49.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一没有人知道他长什样子 －他每三年做一次部整形手术\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Nobody knows what he looks like.   -He has plastic surgery every three years.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.75,1:49:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我过最蠢的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the stupidest thing I ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.96,1:49:56.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-阿密真的有门阵俱乐部？  -泰勒是不是在组织军隧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Is it true about Fight Club in Miami?   -Is Mr. Durden building an army?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.17,1:50:00.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直活在一种似曾相似的情景里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was living in a state of perpetual déja vu.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.18,1:50:04.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每到一个地方 我都觉得自 己好像来过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everywhere I went, I felt I'd already been there.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.10,1:50:07.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像跟一个形人一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was like following an invisible man.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.02,1:50:11.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有血的味道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The smell of dried blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.19,1:50:15.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到处都是的印\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dirty, bare footprints circling each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.23,1:50:18.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有烤一样的味道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That aroma of old sweat, like fried chicken.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.86,1:50:23.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还能感受 前一晚打门的感觉 地板还是热的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The feel of a floor still warm from a fight the night before.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.24,1:50:25.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我每次都比泰勒晚一步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was always just one step behind Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.96,1:50:34.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的名字是罗伯宝森 他的名字是罗伯宝森 他的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His name is Robert Paulsen. His name is Robert Paulsen. His...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.05,1:50:39.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎回来，朱 先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome back, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.18,1:50:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.97,1:50:44.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你识我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know me?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.06,1:50:48.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一这是测试 长官 一不是 不是测试\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Is this a test, sir?   -No. This is not a test.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.73,1:50:52.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你上星期四来过了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were in here last Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.56,1:50:54.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}星期四\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thursday?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.36,1:50:58.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就站在你现在站的那个地方 问我保安状况好不好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were standing where you are now, asking how good security is.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.07,1:51:01.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}情况很好 ，长长官\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's tight as a drum, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.24,1:51:05.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为我是？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.91,1:51:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你真的不是在测试我？  -不是 我没有在测试\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you sure this isn't a test?   -No, this is not a test.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.16,1:51:13.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是德顿先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're Mr. Durden.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.75,1:51:16.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你给我的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the one who gave me this.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.17,1:51:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请回到你的座位上 亚将椅背暨起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please return your seat backs to their full upright and locked position.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.69,1:51:34.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是？  -玛拉 是我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah?   -Marla, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.27,1:51:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们做过？  -做什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Have we ever done it?   -Done what?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.48,1:51:39.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们做过爱？  -这是什蠢问题？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Had sex.   -What kind of stupid question is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.65,1:51:42.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这间题愚蠢是因为答案是做过 还是没有做过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stupid because the answer's yes or because it's no?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.90,1:51:44.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你在恶作剧 一不 我必知道……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Is this a trick?   -No. I need to know...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.99,1:51:49.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你意思是你想要知道 我们刚刚是在做爱还是性交？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wanna know if I think we were just having sex or making love?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.58,1:51:52.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我们做了 一你打电话来就问这个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We did make love?   -ls that what you're calling it?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.46,1:51:55.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请回答问题 到底有没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just answer the question! Did we do it or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.79,1:51:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干了我 又甩掉我 你爱我 又讨我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You fuck me, then snub me. You love me, you hate me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.63,1:52:01.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一会儿感情丰富 一会儿又变成冷酷的混蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're sensitive, then you turn into an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.30,1:52:03.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样描述我俩的关系确吧 泰勒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does that describe our relationship, Tyler?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.64,1:52:06.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的血液降到了冰点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have just lost cabin pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.89,1:52:08.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你刚刚什 一你怎了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What did you say?   -What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.76,1:52:11.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一叫我的名字 -泰勒德顿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Say my name!   -Tyler Durden.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.31,1:52:13.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒德顿 你他妈的神经病 怎回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler Durden, you fucking freak! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.98,1:52:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我马上过来 一我不在那儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm coming over!   -I'm not there!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.11,1:52:20.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没有遵守你的誓言\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You broke your promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.23,1:52:22.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一天啊 泰勒 一你怎可以跟她我的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Jesus, Tyler.   -You talked to her about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.61,1:52:27.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这他妈的是怎一回事？  -我只要求你做一件非常简单的事情\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What the fuck is going on?   -I ask you for one thing. One simple thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.87,1:52:30.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什其他人都以为我是你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do people think that I'm you?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.87,1:52:32.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回答我 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.33,1:52:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.71,1:52:43.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回答我 为什其他人都以为我是你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Answer me. Why do people think I'm you?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.01,1:52:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想你知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.84,1:52:47.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一不 我不知道 一你知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, I don't.   -Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.01,1:52:51.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什其他人都以为我是你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why would anyone possibly confuse you with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.47,1:52:54.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.69,1:53:00.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你想到 了 -不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You got it.   -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.77,1:53:03.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一别他妈的我们 一啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do not fuck with us!   -Say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.07,1:53:06.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.20,1:53:09.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say it!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.41,1:53:13.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我们是同一个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because we're the same person.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.95,1:53:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.12,1:53:17.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只是来这世界走一遭……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are the all-singing, all-dancing...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.79,1:53:21.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我不懂 一你想瓣法改变你的生活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I don't understand this.   -You wanted a way to change your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.59,1:53:23.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是你一个人瓣不到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could not do this on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.88,1:53:27.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一直想要变成我这个样子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All the ways you wish you could be - that's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.30,1:53:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我长得像你希望的样子 用你希望的样子做爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I look like you wanna look, fuck like you wanna fuck,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.68,1:53:35.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明 有能力 最重要的是 我是自 由的 而你相反\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am smart, capable and, most importantly, I'm free in all the ways that you are not.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.14,1:53:37.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗅 不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.27,1:53:40.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}－泰勒不在 他离开 了 一什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Tyler's not here. Tyler went away.   -What?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.52,1:53:44.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一这不可能 这太疯狂了 一每天都有人这样做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This isn't possible. This is crazy.   -People do it every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.03,1:53:48.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们和 自 己话 他们为自 己是他们想的那样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They talk to themselves. They see themselves as they'd like to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.90,1:53:52.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们没有你的勇气 不敢去做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They don't have the courage you have to just run with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.29,1:53:58.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还在扎 有时候还是你自 己\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You still wrestle with it, so sometimes you're still you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.00,1:54:00.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们下次应该再来一次\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We should do this again sometime.
