Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.85,1:54:22.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你有工作 你有生活 一你晚上兼差 因为你睡不著\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You have jobs, a life.   -You work nights because you can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.61,1:54:26.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一所以你制作肥皂 一你还跟玛拉上床 泰勒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Or you stay up and make soap.   -You're fucking Marla, Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.53,1:54:29.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}技术上来 跟她上床的人是你 对她来都一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Technically, you are. But it's all the same to her.
