Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.58,1:54:42.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我们得考一个解决的瓣法 以免破我们的目标\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think we're gonna have to talk about how this might compromise our goals.
