Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.30,1:54:51.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}简直是胡扯 简直是胡扯 我不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is bullshit. This is bullshit! I'm not listening to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.38,1:54:54.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你疯了 一不 疯的是你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You are insane!   -No. You're insane.
