Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.16,1:55:22.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-先生 你要退房了？  -是 寄帐单给我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Sir! Are you checking out?   -Yeah. Bill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.87,1:55:26.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请先付这两通电话的费用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to initial this list of phone calls, please.
