Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.92,1:57:29.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只要一杯咖啡 谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll just have a coffee, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.58,1:57:32.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生 你点什都是免费的 先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, anything you order is free of charge, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.30,1:57:35.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-为什免费？  -别问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why is it free of charge?   -Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.17,1:57:37.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随便\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.51,1:57:38.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要海鲜浓汤\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll have the clam chowder,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.05,1:57:42.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}炸 烤马铃薯 还有巧克力馅饼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}fried chicken with a baked potato and chocolate chiffon pie.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.47,1:57:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要干净的食物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clean food, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.64,1:57:47.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那样的话 先生 我建不要点海鲜浓汤\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In that case, sir, I advise against the clam chowder.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.31,1:57:49.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就不要海鲜浓汤 谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No clam chowder. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.06,1:57:54.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给你30秒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got about 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.69,1:57:58.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛拉 我知道我的行为一直 非常 非常奇怪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know I've been acting very strange, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.24,1:58:01.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道那好像我是双面人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know it seems there's two sides to me...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.82,1:58:03.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}双面 一面是混蛋一面是人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two sides? You're Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Jackass.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.99,1:58:07.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎马我都行 但是我终于领悟了一件非常重要的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I deserved that. But I realized something important.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.41,1:58:08.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什鹰？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.71,1:58:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于我俩的关系 直到现在我才明白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The full extent of our relationship wasn't clear to me until now,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.04,1:58:14.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原因我就不细了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for reasons I won't go into.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.17,1:58:16.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我知道我对你一直不好 一随便\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I know I haven't treated you well.   -Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.67,1:58:21.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 不 15秒 求你 15秒 我完\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no. Fifteen seconds, please! Fifteen seconds, don't open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.64,1:58:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我很抱歉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm trying to tell you I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.85,1:58:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我终于意识到 我真的很喜欢你 玛拉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What I've come to realize is that I really like you, Marla.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.69,1:58:31.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一真的 -真的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You do?   -I really do.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.23,1:58:36.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很在乎你 我不想因为我的原因 而给你带来任何厄运\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I care about you and I don't want anything bad to happen to you because of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.74,1:58:39.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛拉 你有生命危险\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your life is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.20,1:58:44.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一什 一你必离开这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -You need to leave town for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.16,1:58:46.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别留在大城市里 出去露营……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of any major city. Just go camping...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.54,1:58:48.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这神经病\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're an insane person.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.33,1:58:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我已经使你陷入可怕的事情里了 一不 闲嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I've involved you in something terrible.   -No. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.17,1:58:54.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你不安全 一闲嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're not safe.   -Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.71,1:59:00.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一著 我真的试过 泰勒 一我知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Listen, I tried, Tyler. I really tried.   -I Know you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.05,1:59:06.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有些特质我很欣赏 你明 有趣 床上功夫一流\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are things about you I like. You're smart, funny, spectacular in bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.89,1:59:09.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是……你实在很难相处\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But... you're intolerable.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.14,1:59:13.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有很严重的情问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have very serious emotional problems
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.06,1:59:15.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你应该去找专业助\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for which you should seek professional help.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.07,1:59:20.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我知道 很抱歉 一你很抱歉 我很抱歉 大家都很抱歉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I Know, and I'm sorry.   -You're sorry, I'm sorry, everyone's sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.61,1:59:23.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我无法再这样续下去了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't do this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.45,1:59:26.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做不到 也不想做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't. I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.79,1:59:30.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.04,1:59:33.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能离开 玛拉 你不安全\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't leave, Marla! You're not safe!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.88,1:59:38.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}－玛拉 ，你不懂 一别碰我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Marla, you don't understand!   -Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.67,1:59:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想保护你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am trying to protect you!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.09,1:59:44.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我不想再见到你 一如果那是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I never want to see you again!   -If that's what it takes...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.64,1:59:46.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.43,1:59:52.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停著别动 嘴 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold it right there! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.40,1:59:57.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带这些 上这车 我向你保证以后对不再你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take this money and get on this bus. I promise I will never bother you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.11,1:59:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闲嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.48,2:00:02.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜上车 ，拜上车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please get on the bus. Please get on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.99,2:00:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你为什要这样做？  -因为他们为你是个威督\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why are you doing this?   -They think you're a threat.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.91,2:00:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没瓣法解稞 相信我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't explain now. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.12,2:00:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你去哪 否则你就有危\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I see where you're going, you won't be safe.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.12,2:00:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会还你 我把这当作你应该给我的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not paying this back. I consider it asshole tax.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.83,2:00:17.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿去吧 记住 千万不要待在大城市 至少这天不要 好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. Remember, stay out of major cities for a couple of days, OK?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.71,2:00:19.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.46,2:00:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我一生中最糟的经历\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the worst thing that ever happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.69,2:00:40.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好 我要自首\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello. I need you to arrest me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.86,2:00:43.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是一个恐怖组的领导人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am the leader of a terrorist organization
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.19,2:00:47.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经犯下了好宗火 破壤 以及遍及本市的暴力撃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}responsible for numerous acts of vandalism and assault all over this city.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.37,2:00:51.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全国各大城市 或许有好百个成员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the metropolitan area, we had probably 200 members.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.24,2:00:56.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经备引爆 五六个主要城市装好的炸弹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chapters have sprung up in five or six other major cities already.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.33,2:00:59.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是一个严密的组\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a tightly regimented organization
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.63,2:01:04.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有很多能干的行动小组 不用人领导也能行动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with many cells capable of operating independent of central leadership.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.18,2:01:09.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去查查那间房子 好？ 佩柏街1537号\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go to the house, OK? 1537 Paper Street.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.64,2:01:11.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我们的总部\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's our headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.35,2:01:16.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在后花园地底下 埋有伯宝森的屁体\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the back, buried in the garden, you'll find the body of Robert Paulsen.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.52,2:01:19.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在地下室 里面有个浴缸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the basement, you'll find some bathtubs
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.94,2:01:24.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最近被用来 制造了大量的硝化甘油\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that have been used very recently to make large quantities of nitroglycerin.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.78,2:01:28.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我相信他们的计画是要炸掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I believe the plan is to blow up the headquarters
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.70,2:01:30.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有信用卡公司的总部\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of these credit-card companies
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.62,2:01:32.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有TRW大楼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the TRW building.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.16,2:01:37.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什选这些大楼？ 为什要炸信用卡公司\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why these buildings? Why credit-card companies?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.92,2:01:41.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果一切的记录都被销毁 我们全都会回到原来的起点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you erase the debt record, then we all go back to zero.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.21,2:01:44.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这将造成总体的混\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll create total chaos.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.84,2:01:49.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}镶他续 我去打个电话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep him talking. I need to make a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.98,2:02:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很敬佩你的所作所为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really admire what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.57,2:02:06.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什？  -这样做需要很大的勇气\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -You're a brave man to order this.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.24,2:02:09.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个天才 一，先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a genius, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.11,2:02:13.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你任何人妨破计划 即使是你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said if anyone ever interferes with Project Mayhem, even you,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.24,2:02:16.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就要割下他的卵蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we gotta get his balls.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.91,2:02:20.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一别反抗 一这真是个高明的瓣法 德顿先生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't fight.   -It's a powerful gesture, Mr. Durden.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.46,2:02:23.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一它树立了一个很好的例 一你们犯了一个很大的错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It'll set quite an example.   -You're making a big mistake!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.71,2:02:25.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你过你会这 一我不是泰勒德顿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You said you'd say that.   -I'm not Tyler Durden!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.00,2:02:28.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也过你会这\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You told us you'd say that too.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.84,2:02:30.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 我是泰勒德顿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. I am Tyler Durden.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.93,2:02:35.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}著 我现在直接命令中止这项行动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen to me. I'm giving you a direct order. We're aborting this mission now.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.64,2:02:38.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你过你肯定会这的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said you would definitely say that.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.14,2:02:41.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.94,2:02:46.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们他妈的疯了 你们是警察\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you fucking out of your minds? You're police officers!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.40,2:02:49.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁来开始？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is somebody timing this?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.95,2:02:52.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我闲嘴 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.03,2:02:54.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可恶！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.79,2:03:00.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-部分信息已经得到证实……  -嗯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Some of this information checks out.   -Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.16,2:03:04.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-备到那儿去看看吧 在佩柏街 一马上来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let's go to that house on Paper Street.   -Be right there.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.38,2:03:06.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 ，等等 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.63,2:03:07.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你行 一问题\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You got him?   -I got him.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.96,2:03:09.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生 我们必须这做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, we have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.67,2:03:12.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一别反抗了 一橡皮筋在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Stop fighting!   -Where's the rubber band?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.51,2:03:15.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开我 把他妈的刀放下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get away from me! Drop that fucking knife!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.56,2:03:22.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后 马上给我趴下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Back up. Face down on the floor right now!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.23,2:03:26.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}趴在地板上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get down on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.65,2:03:34.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先出这扇门 就吃子弹 明白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First person that comes out this door gets a lead salad! Understand?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.60,2:04:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚开！滚开 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get away! Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.66,2:04:16.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直跑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}/ ran.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.32,2:04:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一直跑 直到肌肉酸痛抽筋 快呼吸困难\N{\rEN\blur0.8}/ ran until my muscles burned and my veins pumped battery acid.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.96,2:04:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后续跑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then I ran some more.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.00,2:04:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}富兰克林街
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.54,2:05:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你他妈的在干嘛？ 穿著内裤到处跑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the fuck are you doing, running around in your underpants?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.63,2:05:12.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看起来像个神经病\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look crazy!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.50,2:05:15.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我心里有数 我知道这里会发生什事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I'm onto you. I know what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.59,2:05:20.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样 我给你留了好位置 好像在看一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, then. I got us a great place to watch from. It'll be like Pay-per-view.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.49,2:05:42.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通往车库的手扶梯
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.70,2:05:44.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}电梯
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.06,2:06:10.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢’ 天啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Christ.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.44,2:06:12.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在要干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:12.36,2:06:14.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}－我要阻止这件事 一为什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm stopping this.   -Why?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.98,2:06:18.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一这是我们做过最伟大的事 一我不能这种事发生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The greatest thing you've ever done.   -I can't let this happen.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.86,2:06:21.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道 还有10枚炸弹 在另外10座大楼里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are 10 other bombs in 10 other buildings.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.57,2:06:23.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什鹰时候破计画变成谋杀了 ？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Since when is Project Mayhem about murder?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.78,2:06:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大楼是空的 我们没有杀人 我们在解救他们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The buildings are empty. We're not killing anyone. We're setting them free!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.12,2:06:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伯死了 他们一枪了他的头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bob is dead. They shot him in the head.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.54,2:06:34.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要煎蛋 就必打破蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wanna make an omelet, you gotta break eggs.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.71,2:06:38.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我不理你 你根本不存在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I'm not listening to you. You're not even there.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.39,2:06:49.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会那样做 除非知道那些电线是什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wouldn't do that. Not unless I knew which wires were what.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.39,2:06:51.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你知道 我就知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you know, then I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.69,2:07:01.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许……我知道你想我这儿知道 所以我花了一整天想著错的那条\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or... maybe I Knew you'd know, so I spent all day thinking about the wrong ones.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.91,2:07:11.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎想？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.58,2:07:15.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，天 天啊 不是色的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, heavens, no. Not the green one.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.21,2:07:17.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了色的 哪一条都行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pull any one but the green one.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.76,2:07:25.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫你住手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I asked you not to do that!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.56,2:07:29.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他妈的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.02,2:07:32.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒 离开汽车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler, get away from the van.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.23,2:07:37.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒 我没开玩笑 离开汽车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler, I'm not kidding! Get away from the van!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.15,2:07:39.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可恶！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.90,2:07:43.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇 ！只 哇 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.20,2:07:47.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}OK.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.54,2:07:50.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在用枪 对著你想像出来的朋友开火\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are now firing a gun at your imaginary friend
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.75,2:07:53.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}旁还有400加俞的炸药 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}near 400 gallons of nitroglycerin!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.75,2:07:57.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样 泰勒 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cool it, Tyler!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.81,2:08:13.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样 不要走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aw, come on! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.64,2:08:54.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什鹰？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.36,2:09:42.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三分钟 时间到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three minutes. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.23,2:09:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回到最初\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The beginning.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.44,2:09:46.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}备引爆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ground zero.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.99,2:09:51.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一这就是我们故事开始的地方 一要点什来纪念这一刻？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-/ think this is about where we came in.   -Want to say a few words for the occasion?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.29,2:09:55.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你什？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.50,2:09:57.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还没想好要什\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I still can't think of anything.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.21,2:10:01.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊 重演有趣的片段\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah. Flashback humor.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.97,2:10:09.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}越来越刺激了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's getting exciting now.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:10.55,2:10:14.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有雨分半钟 想想我们过去已经实现的成就吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two and a half. Think of everything we've accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.98,2:10:20.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通过这些窗子 我们会看到 金融崩潢的历史画面\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Out these windows, we will view the collapse of financial history.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.23,2:10:23.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}离经济自由又近了一步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One step closer to economic equilibrium.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.00,2:10:40.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-她怎会在这？  -不可放过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why is she here?   -Tying up loose ends.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.46,2:10:44.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把我放下 你这秃子 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put me down, you bald-headed fuck!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.96,2:10:49.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我求求你 不要这样 一不是我做的 是我们俩做的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I beg you, please don't do this.   -I'm not doing this. We are doing this.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:49.42,2:10:52.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一这就是我们想要的 一不 我不想这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This is what we want.   -No. I don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.60,2:10:57.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错 你 已经没有价值了 我们得把你忘了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Except "you" is meaningless now. We have to forget about you.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:58.27,2:11:01.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你只是我脑中的声音而已 一你也是我脑中的声音\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're a voice in my head.   -You're a voice in mine!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:01.27,2:11:04.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-为什我无法除掉你？  -你需要我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why can't I get rid of you?   -You need me.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.94,2:11:07.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我不需要 我真的不需要你了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I don't. I really don't anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.36,2:11:11.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是你创造出来的 我可不是为了 自 己感觉好一点才创造你这物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You created me. I didn't create some loser alter ego to make me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.66,2:11:14.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一付点责任吧 一我会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Take some responsibility.   -I do.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.12,2:11:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我接受这一切\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am responsible for all of it, and I accept that.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:17.70,2:11:21.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因此 我求求你了 请放这一切吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, please, I'm begging you, please call this off.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.79,2:11:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我曾经我们失望过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have I ever let us down?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.42,2:11:30.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我 你成长了不少吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How far have you come because of me?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.60,2:11:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会照顾著你的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will bring us through this.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.76,2:11:41.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像往常一样 我会保护你 即使你又哭又\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As always, I will carry you kicking and screaming,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.73,2:11:44.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最后你还是会感谢我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and in the end you will thank me.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.44,2:11:46.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒 泰勒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler. Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:47.07,2:11:50.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很感谢你 你为我做的一切事情\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm grateful to you for everything that you've done for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:51.03,2:11:53.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是这次太过份了 我不想要这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But this is too much. I don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:53.53,2:11:58.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你要什 回去做原来的工作？ 回到以前的公寓 看电视剧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you want? Your shit job back? Fucking condo world, watching sitcoms?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.41,2:12:00.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去你妈的 我不干 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fuck you! I won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.46,2:12:05.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一这不是真的 一都已经备好了 闲嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This can't be happening.   -It's already done, so shut up!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.88,2:12:09.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}－倒数60秒 一不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-60 seconds till CRI.   -No.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.09,2:12:14.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能平的 这些都是假的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can figure this out. This isn't even real.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:14.43,2:12:18.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不是真实的 枪也不是…… 你手上根本没枪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not real. That gun... That gun isn't even in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.43,2:12:21.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}枪在我的手上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The gun's in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:27.36,2:12:30.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真好 可是什都没改变\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good for you. It doesn't change a thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:38.37,2:12:41.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干嘛拿枪顶著自 己的脑袋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do you wanna put a gun to your head?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:41.83,2:12:43.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是我的头 泰勒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not my head, Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.04,2:12:45.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我们的头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our head.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.58,2:12:49.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真有趣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.46,2:12:55.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这是要干嘛 时尚小子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are you going with this, IKEA boy?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.43,2:13:04.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 这是你和我俩人的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. It's you and me.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:08.15,2:13:09.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}朋友？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Friends?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.90,2:13:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}泰勒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tyler,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.61,2:13:18.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要真我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to really listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:18.87,2:13:20.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}OK.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.91,2:13:23.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的眼睛睁开著\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My eyes are open.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:41.30,2:13:43.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什味道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's that smell?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.74,2:14:07.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-其他人呢？  -怎回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where is everybody?   -Oh, no. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.58,2:14:09.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德顿先生 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Durden!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.46,2:14:11.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗅 天啊 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.96,2:14:13.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.46,2:14:19.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你……你没事吧 先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you... Are you all right, sir?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:20.05,2:14:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我没事 一你看起来很糟糕 怎回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, yeah, I'm OK.   -You look terrible, sir. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.10,2:14:27.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一噢，没什 没事 一不 先生 他没开玩笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, nothing, it's no problem.   -No, no, no, sir. He's not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:27.85,2:14:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你看起来很糟糕 你需要马上治疗 一我没事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You look awful. You need assistance.   -I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.98,2:14:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很好 一切都很好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I'm fine. Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:36.53,2:14:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ow! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:39.49,2:14:41.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一放开她 一我的天啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let her go.   -Christ Almighty!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:42.82,2:14:44.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.83,2:14:46.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好 玛拉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Marla.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.66,2:14:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一把她留在这里 到楼下会合 一你确定？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Leave her with me. Meet me downstairs.   -Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:51.83,2:14:53.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我确定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:55.34,2:14:59.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个混蛋 什他妈的无聊的游 居然把我带来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You fucker! What sick fucking game are you playing at, putting me on a...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:59.59,2:15:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，我的天啊 ，你的 ！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, your face!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.05,2:15:03.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.02,2:15:11.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-怎回事？  -不要问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What happened?   -Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:11.31,2:15:13.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你中枪了 一对 我中枪了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're shot.   -Yes, I'm shot.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.36,2:15:15.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，我的天啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:15.32,2:15:18.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一不敢相信他还能站著 一真他妈的强悍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I can't believe he's standing.   -Tough motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.82,2:15:24.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.91,2:15:26.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实是我自\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did, actually.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:27.24,2:15:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找点纱布来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Find some gauze.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.58,2:15:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你开枪射你 自 己 一对 没事了 玛拉 看著我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You shot yourself?   -Yes, but it's OK. Marla, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.96,2:15:36.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的没事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm really OK.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.96,2:15:40.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我 一切都没事了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trust me. Everything's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.31,2:15:57.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们相遇是在我人生中 非常的一段时间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You met me at a very strange time in my life.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:59.48,2:16:02.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的在空中 你的头在地上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With your feet on the air and your head on the ground
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.87,2:16:09.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}努力哄它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Try this trick and spin it
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.16,2:16:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:12.41,2:16:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的脑袋虚脱了 可是里面什都没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your head will collapse but there's nothing in it
Dialogue: 0,2:16:15.67,2:16:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要问问 自 己\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you'll ask yourself
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.92,2:16:26.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的心灵在哪里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is my mind?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:34.48,2:16:39.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出到水里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Way out in the water
Dialogue: 0,2:16:39.23,2:16:41.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到它在游泳？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See it swimming?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.78,2:16:49.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在加勒比海游泳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was swimming in the Caribbean
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.37,2:16:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}动物藏在岩石后面\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Animals were hiding behind a rock
